4:
Lameka yaagira abakazi be ati:
Ada na Ziila, mumpurire;
Naimwe baka Lameka, muhurire ebi ndikugamba;
Nyitsire omushaija ahabw'okumputaaza,
N'omutsigazi ahabw'okunteera.

27:
Enganda z'abantu zikuheereze, n'amahanga gakwinamire;
Otegyekye beene sho, n'abaana ba nyoko bakwinamire.
Weena orikukyeena, akyeenwe;
Kandi weena orikushabira omugisha, nawe aheebwe omugisha.

49:
Ori nk'amaizi agatahamira hamwe; toriheebwa bukuru,
Ahakuba okatemba ekitabo kya sho;
Waakihagara. Waaza ahu mbyama!

Iwe Yuda, beene sho baryakuhimbisa;
Omukono gwawe guryakwata abazigu baawe aha bitsya;
Beene sho baryakwinamira.

Yuda n'ekitsigazi ky'entare;
Mwana wangye, oinamukire, nooruga aha ki waita;
Yainama, yaabundama nk'entare,
Kandi nk'entare enkazi; n'oha owaakwemera kumusisiimura?

Enkoni y'obugabe teriruga ahari Yuda,
N'obu yaakuba ey'obutegyeki kumuruga aha bigyere,
Okuhitsya obu mukama waayo ariija;

Zebuluuni aryatuura aha rubaju rw'enyanja;
Abe enyambukiro y'emeeri;
Omwatano gwe guryagarukira ahari Sidoni.

Akareeba omwanya gw'okuruhuukiramu ku guri murungi,
Kandi n'ensi ku erikushemeza;
Yainika eibega rye okwekorera;
Atyo yaahinduka omuhuuku w'okugyemwa emirimo.

Yosefu n'eitaagi eririkwana munonga,
Eitaagi eririkwana munonga haihi n'enshuro;
Amataagi ge garengyera aha rugo rw'amabaare.

Benyamiini n'omushega ogurikutaanyagura;
Omu kasheeshe gurya eki gwitsire,
Omu mwabazyo gubagana eminyago.

15:
Ebigaari bya Faraho n'eihe rye abinagire omu nyanja;
Abakuru b'engabo ze abatoorainwe barohamire omu
Nyanja erikutukura.

Omwitsyo gw'amaani ogw'omu nyindo zaawe gutuumire hamwe amaizi,
Amaizi agaaba nigagyenda gaayetuuma hamwe omutuumo;
Okuzimu omunda y'enyanja haakwata.

Abazigu bagizire bati: Ka tubakurate, tubakwate,
Tubagane eminyago, tubeemarireho akaturi aha mutima;
Nitwija kusyorayo zaarurara zaitu, emikono yaitu ebacwekyereze.

Hati abatware ba Edomu nibatangaara;
Emanzi za Moabu nizitetema;
Abatwire omuri Kanaani boona emitima ebahweire omunda.

23:
Balamu yaagamba ebigambo bye, naahanuura ati:
Imuka, Balaki, ohurire;
Iwe mwene Zipori, ntega amatu!

24:
Ruhanga amwihire omuri Misri;
Aine amaani nk'ag'embogo;
Aryamaraho amahanga agarikumurwanisa,
Ahendagure amagufa gaabo,
Abarashe, aboozyemu emyambi ye.

Balamu yaagamba ebigambo bye, naahanuura ati:
Okuhanuura kwa Balamu mwene Beori,
Okuhanuura kw'omushaija obaire ahumire;

Nimmureeba, n'obu ndaabe ntarikumureeba hati;
Mmuhangire amaisho, n'obu araabe atari haihi;
Enyonyoozi eryaruga omuri Yakobo,
N'enkoni y'obugabe eimukye omuri Israeli;
Eryateera embaju zoona eza Moabu
Ecwekyereze beene Sheesi boona.

Yaagaruka yaareeba Abakeeni, yaagamba ebigambo bye naahanuura ati:
Ahu otwire n'ah'amaani;
N'ekyashuri kyawe kiri omu rukiri;

Kwonka emeeri ziryaruga Kitimu,
Zibonabonese Ashuri na Eberi;
Nawe acwekyerere.

32:
Rukiri, omurimo gwe guhikire;
Ahakuba emitwarize ye yoona n'ey'oburyo;
Ni Ruhanga ow'okwesigwa, otagira kutahikiirira;
N'ow'amazima, kandi ohikiriire.

Bamukoreire ebitahikire;
Tibakiri baana be ahabw'obumogo bwabo;
N'ab'obusingye oburikwehabagiza kandi obukiikami.

Baanyitsize eihari aha kitari Ruhanga Nyamuhanga;
Bankwatsize ekiniga n'ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa;
Naanye ndyabaitsa eihari aha bantu abatari ihanga buzima;
Mbakwatse ekiniga n'eihanga eritaine bwengye;

Kandi omuzaabibu gwabo gukakomooka aha gwa Sodoma,
N'omu misiri ya Gomora;
Ebijuma by'emizaabibu yaabo n'endurwe,
Emitsitsa y'ebijuma byayo neeshaarira;

Okuhoora enzigu n'okwangye, n'okuzimuura n'okwangye,
Omu bunaku obu ebigyere byabo biriterereramu;
Ahabw'okuba ekiro kyabo eky'okuhikwaho akabi kiri haihi;
N'ekifubiro kyabo kiryarahuka;

Ku ndityaza rurara yangye erikumurinkana,
Omukono gwangye gwagikwata kucwa emanja;
Ndyahoora abazigu bangye,
Nzimuurire abarikuunyanga;

33:
Naagira ati:
MUKAMA akaruga Sinai;
Yaabajugutira nk'omushekye, naaruga Seiri,
Yaayakira aha rushozi Parani;
Yaaruga omu bukumi bw'abarikwera,
Omuriro guri aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo.

Owaagambire ahari ishe na nyina,
Ati: Tindikubamanya;
Akooga beene ishe, kandi ateete aha baana be;
Ahakuba Abaleevi bakoorobera ekigambo kyawe,
Baakwata endagaano yaawe.

Enimi ye y'omujigaijo ekitiinisa n'ekyayo;
Amahembe gaayo n'ag'embogo;
Eryagabingisa amahanga goona
Gahikye aha muheru gw'ensi;
Ago mahembe nibwo bukumi bwingi bwa Efuraimu,
N'enkumi nyingi za Manaase.

N'ahari Asheri yaagira ati:
Asheri aheebwe omugisha gw'okuzaara abaana;
Akundwe beene ishe;
Ajabikye ekigyere kye omu majuta.

Empimbi zaawe zibe ebyoma n'emiringa;
Nk'oku ebiro byawe biriingana,
N'amaani gaawe nikwo gariba.

5:
Sisera yaayefunya, yaagwa;
Yaagangarama aha bigyere bye;
Ahu yaagwa, niho yaafeera.

2:
Bwanyima Hanna yaasiima naagira ati:
Omutima gwangye nigwesiimira omuri MUKAMA;
Eihembe ryangye ritunguuriirwe omuri MUKAMA;
N'akanwa kangye nikashekyerera abazigu bangye,
Ahakuba ninshemerererwa okujuna kwawe.

Tihariho orikwera nka MUKAMA,
Tihariho ondiijo kureka Iwe wenka;
Kandi tihariho Rukiri ori nka Ruhanga waitu.

Mutagaruka kugamba eby'okwehimbisa;
N'eby'amaryo birekye kuruga omu kanwa kaanyu;
Ahakuba MUKAMA ni Ruhanga orikumanya byona;
Kandi niwe arenga ebi abantu bakora.

Aryarinda ebigyere by'abarikwera be,
Kwonka ababi baryahwerekyererera omu mwirima;
Ahakuba tihariho muntu orisinguza amaani ge.

1:
Obuta bwa Yonasaani bukaba butagaruka nyima
Kuruga aha shagama y'abaitsirwe, n'aha mamanzi ebikaaka;
Kandi rurara ya Saulo ekaba etagaruka busha.

22:
Ruhanga wangye, orukiri rwangye, ou nyesiga,
Omunaara gwangye omuraingwa, n'obuhungiro bwangye;
Omujuni wangye, niiwe onkiza omwaga.

Bwanyima ensi yaatengyeta, yaatetema;
N'emisingi y'eiguru yaanyiganyiga,
Yaatengyetsibwa ekiniga kye.

Okankiza okurwana n'amahanga,
Wandinda ngu mbe mukuru waago;
Naaheerezibwa eihanga eri ntakamanyaga.

23:
Kureka orikwenda kugakoraho
Ashemereire kugakoresaho ekyoma n'orubango rw'eicumu;
Kandi baryabookyeza kimwe n'omuriro.

16:
Mugambe ku MUKAMA aine ekitiinisa ekishemereire eiziina rye,
Mureete empongano, mwije omu maisho ge;
Muramye MUKAMA mujwaire ebirikwera;

3:
Eryo izooba rihinduka omwirima!
Ruhanga ow'ahaiguru areka kuryetaho,
Kandi rireka kujwerwa omushana;

Ekyo kiro kikwatwa omwirima ndindindi,
Kireka kushemererwa omu biro by'omwaka,
N'obu kwakuba okubarirwa omu gandi meezi;

Enyonyoozi z'omu buturuturu bwaryo zireka kujwa,
Ritegyereza omushana, guriburira,
Kandi ribura kureeba okujuguta kw'omushekye;

4:
Gwayemerera aho, kwonka tinaamanya oku gurikushusha;
Omu maisho gangye haabamu waringa.
Haabaho akaceceko, bwanyima naahurira eiraka eririkugira riti:

Kaashwa abo abatuura omu maka g'eitaka,
Agu omusingi gwago guri omu mucuucu;
Abarikuribatwa bakatanga ekiyenje kubaruka.

5:
Ebi ashaarwire biriibwa abaine enjara,
Bagaruka batwara n'ebiri omu mahwa;
Abaine eiriho bainiire ebintu bye ekyaka;

7:
Ku mbyama, ngira nti: Nibusheesha ryari, nkaimuka?
Kwonka ekiro kigyenda ira;
Ndaara niinyehindaguturana, burugaho busheesha.

Nikyo ntarikubaasiza kwezibira kugamba;
Niinyija kugambisibwa obusaasi bw'omu mutima gwangye,
Nyetomboite ahabw'entimba y'omu magara gangye.

9:
Ensi eheirweyo omu mikono y'ababi,
Ashweka amaisho g'abaramuzi baayo;
Ku araabe atari We, ondiijo n'oha?

10:
Ntamirwe amagara gangye;
Tindikwija kwezibira kutaka;
Niinyija kugamba ahabw'obusaasi bw'omu mutima gwangye.

Ku mba mubi, ndeeba enaku;
Ku mba ohikiriire, timbaasa kwimutsya mutwe;
Ahabw'okuba mba nyijwire okuhemuka,
Nindeeba okubonabona kwangye.

12:
Kwonka naanye nyine obwengye nkaimwe;
Timurikunkira.
Mbwenu n'oha otarikumanya ebigambo nk'ebyo?

Amahema g'abambuzi gari gye;
Abarikugwisa kubi Ruhanga bahamire,
Abu emikono yaabo eba ruhanga waabo.

14:
Nikwo n'omuntu abyama ataimukye;
Tariimuka, n'obu kwakuba okusisiimurwa,
Okuhitsya obu eiguru ririba ritakiriho.

Amaizi gagyenda nigarya amabaare,
N'emitunga etwara eitaka ry'ensi;
Naiwe nikwo omaraho amatsiko g'omuntu.

15:
Ebirikutiinisa biteerera enduuru omu matu ge;
N'obu ariba ari omu kugogyera,
Omuhwerekyerezi aryamugwaho.

16:
Kuri noogira ngu niimwe muri nkaanye,
Nkaabaasize kugamba nkaimwe;
Nyungayunga ebigambo by'okubapaatiika,
Mbazongoreza omutwe;

Ankwatsire; nikyo kirikunshinja,
Okuhwa aha magufa kwangye kuunyimukiriire;
Nikwo kurikuunyomesereza.

Antaanyagwize anyiniire ekiniga, yaanyita kubi;
Anneneire amaino,
Ogwo mubisha wangye anzooreire amaisho.

Abantu baanyashamiire,
Banteera aha itama nibanjuma;
Nibateeranira hamwe kunteera.

Nkaba ndi aho ngaramisiriize, yampendagura;
Yankwata aha bitsya, yancwa obusaasingo;
Bwanyima yangira ekimaasho kye.

24:
Eriisho ry'enshambani ritegyereza orwita-waabo,
Neegira eti, tihaine orandeebe;
Ayetwekyerera ahamaisho.

Batunguurwa; ku hahwaho akaanya kakye, bahwaho;
Bagarurwa ahansi, baihwa omu muhanda nk'abandi boona,
Bagyeshwa nk'obushiisha bw'engano.

26:
Reeba, ebyo nibyo, kwonka n'otw'aha rubaju omu mitwarize ye,
Kandi n'ebi tumuhuriraho ni bikye munonga nk'okugambirana omu kutu;
Kwonka okuhinda kw'obushoboorozi bwe n'oha orikubaasa kukwetegyereza?

28:
Batimba ebiina hare n'ahu abantu batwire;
Beebwa abagyenzi, barereetera hare n'abantu,
Beecunda nibakora oku n'oku.

30:
Aha rubaju rwangye rwa buryo haimukire omutwe gw'abantu abataine ku bari,
Bambinga, bamburabuza,
Barunda eby'okutemberaho ngu bancwekyereze;

Ebirikutiinisa biinyehindukiriize,
Ekitiinisa kyangye kibingirwe nk'ekirikubingwa omuyaga;
Okugogyeera kwangye nikuyaayuuka nk'ekicu.

31:
Ahabw'okutiina munonga omutwe muhango gw'abantu,
N'okutiina okugaywa ab'emiryango yaitu,
Kikandeetera kuhunama n'okutashohora;

32:
Atyo Elihu mwene Barakeeli Omubuuzi yaagira ati:
Ndi muto; imwe muri abagurusi;
Nikyo kindeeteire kutiina, ntarahukye kubamanyisa eki ndikuteekateeka;

Reeba, mbaire ntegyereize ebigambo byanyu;
Obu mubaire nimuteekateeka eby'okugamba,
Naagira ngu, mpurire ebi muraagambe.

1:
Aine omugisha omuntu otakuratira naama z'ababi,
Nari okwemerera omu muhanda gw'abasisi,
N'obu kwakuba okushutama aha bitebe by'abarikugaya;

2:
Niinyija kuranga ekiragiro kya MUKAMA;
Yangira ati: Ori Omwana wangye,
Eri izooba naakuzaara.

3:
Ai bambe MUKAMA, imuka;
Ruhanga wangye, njuna;
Ahakuba okateera abazigu bangye boona aha mushaya,
Waacwa amaino g'ababi.

5:
Kwonka nyowe, ahabw'embabazi zaawe nyingi
Ndyataaha omu nju yaawe;
Ndamye ntaire amaisho ahari hekalu yaawe erikwera ninkuha ekitiinisa.

Obasingise orubanja, ai Ruhanga;
Bagwe ahabw'enaama zaabo;
Obabingye ahabw'eby'okushiisha byabo bingi,
Ahakuba bakugomeire.

Kwonka boona abarikukuhungiraho bashemererwe;
Bagume bateere akaari ahabw'okunanuka;
Ahakuba niiwe obarinda,
Kandi n'abakunda eiziina ryawe bashemerererwe omuriiwe.

6:
Okutsinda kunkabize;
Buri kiro ndirira aha kitabo kyangye;
Ekitanda kyangye nkijubya n'amarira.

7:
Imuka, ai MUKAMA, n'ekiniga kyawe,
Oyemerere ogungire abazigu bangye abaanyiniire ekiniga kingi;
Sisiimuka, Ruhanga wangye; ahakuba niiwe waaragiire kucwa orubanja.

MUKAMA acwera amahanga emanja;
Ai MUKAMA, oncwere orubanja nk'okuhikiirira kwangye oku kuri,
N'amazima agari omuriinye oku gari.

9:
Ngu mbone kumanyisa okuhimbisibwa kwawe kwona;
Kandi ndyashemerererwa okujuna kwawe
Omu marembo ga Saayuuni.

10:
Ahiirwa omu mihanda ye obutoosha bwona;
Okucwa emanja kwawe kumuri hare ahu atarikureeba;
Abazigu be boona abeeshaanya.

Agwera omu birorero;
Omu myanya eyekiikire nimwo aitira abataine kabi;
Amaisho ge agata aha bataine kihwera omu mubonano.

Agwera ayesherekire nk'entare eri omu ryaya ryayo;
Agwera omuntu enshoberwa kumukwata;
Kandi kwo amukwata, amukuruza ekigoye kye.

Okireebire; ahakuba oyetegyereza eitima n'okushaazya,
Ngu obone kubikoraho n'omukono gwawe;
Omuntu enshoberwa ayeta omu mikono yaawe;
Ahakuba niiwe oshangwa oba omuhwezi w'efuuzi.

11:
MUKAMA niwe mpungiraho;
Noobaasa ota kungira oti:
Hungira aha bibungo nk'enyonyi;

MUKAMA ari omuri hekalu ye erikwera,
Ekitebe kya MUKAMA kiri omu iguru;
Amaisho ge gareeba abantu, n'ekitsigye kye kibagyeza.

15:
Otabeiherera bandi na rurimi rwe,
N'obu kwakuba okukora kubi mugyenzi we,
Nari okuyaaga mutaahi we;

Otaine mugasho agaywa omu maisho ge,
Kwonka abatiina MUKAMA abaha ekitiinisa;
Ku arahira, n'obu afeerwa, tahinduka.

16:
Oryanyoreka omuhanda gw'amagara,
Omu maisho gaawe hariho okushemererwa kwingi munonga;
Omu mukono gwawe gwa buryo harimu ebirikushemeza ebiro byona.

17:
Ku oraarengye omutima gwangye, wantaayaayira nyekiro,
Wangyeza, torikwija kundeebamu kibi kyona;
Mmaririire kutashiisha n'akanwa kangye.

18:
Bwanyima ensi yaatengyeta, yaatetema;
N'emisingi y'ebibungo yaanyiganyiga,
Yaatengyetsibwa ekiniga kye.

MUKAMA yaahindira omu iguru,
Rukira-boona yaagamba n'eiraka rye,
Haija orubaare n'amakara agarikwaka;

Ruhanga ogwo, omuhanda gwe n'oguhikire;
Okuraganisa kwa MUKAMA kurengirwe, n'okw'amazima;
Niwe ngabo ekingira abamuhungiraho boona.

Okankiza okurwana n'amahanga,
Wampindura omukuru waago;
Naaheerezibwa abantu abu ntakamanyaga.

Akankiza abazigu;
Eego, okanta ahaiguru y'abarikundwanisa,
Waanyiha omu mikono y'abanyamwaga.

19:
Riruga aha muheru gw'eiguru,
Ryehinguririza, rihika aha gundi;
Tihariho kisherekwa okwotsya kwaryo.

Ekiragiro kya MUKAMA kihikire,
Kigarura omutima omunda; Ebi MUKAMA yaahamize n'eby'okwesigwa,
Biha obwengye otabwine;

Eby'okwegyesa bya MUKAMA bihikire,
Bigwisa gye omutima;
Ekiragiro kya MUKAMA kishemeire,
Kihwezesa amaisho;

21:
Oryabagira nk'ekikoomi ekirikubuguma omu biro by'ekiniga kyawe;
MUKAMA aryabamira n'ekiniga kye,
Kandi omuriro guryabamaraho.

22:
Amaani gampweiremu, nyomire nk'orugusyo,
Orurimi rundamatiire aha nkanka;
Ontaire omu mucuucu gw'okufa.

Embwa ziinyehinguririize,
Omutwe gw'enkozi z'ebibi guntaire ahagati;
Banfumwire ebiganja n'ebigyere.

Ab'embaju zoona ez'ensi baryaijuka,
Bahindukire MUKAMA;
N'enganda zoona ez'amahanga ziryaramiza omu maisho ge;

25:
Ai Ruhanga wangye, niiwe nyesiga;
Otandeka kwitwa enshoni,
Otaikiriza abazigu bangye kuunyehimbisizaho.

Onyebembere omu mazima gaawe, kandi onyegyese,
ahakuba niiwe Ruhanga w'okujunwa kwangye;
Niiwe ntegyereza eizooba ryona.

Otaijuka ebibi by'obutsigazi bwangye, n'obu byakuba eby'okushiisha byangye;
Onyijukye nk'embabazi zaawe oku ziri,
Ahabw'oburungi bwawe, ai MUKAMA.

27:
MUKAMA niwe mushana gwangye kandi okujunwa kwangye;
N'oha ou nditiina?
MUKAMA niwe maani g'amagara gangye;
Orintiinisa n'oha?

N'obu engabo zaakuteeka enteeko kundwanisa,
Omutima gwangye tigukaatiina;
N'obu orugamba rwakumbaho, hoona nabwo nkaaguma omutima.

Otaanyima amaisho, otabinga omwiru waawe n'ekiniga;
Niiwe waabaire ori Omuhwezi wangye;
Otannaga, n'obu kwakuba okuntsigaho,
Ai Ruhanga ow'okujunwa kwangye.

28:
Ai MUKAMA, niiwe ndikutakira;
Iwe Rukiri rwangye, otaanyetsiza;
Ahakuba ku waakuunyetsiza,
Nkaaba nk'abarikushuuma omu Kiina.

Ahakuba tibata mutima ha mirimo ya MUKAMA,
Nari aha bi emikono ye ekora;
Aryabasheenya, taribombeka bundi.

MUKAMA niwe maani gangye, kandi engabo yangye;
Omutima gwangye gumwesigire, naahwerwa;
Nikyo omutima gwangye gushemerererwa munonga,
Nkamusingiza n'ekyeshongoro kyangye.

31:
Ndyashemererwa, nyesiime ahabw'embabazi zaawe;
Ahakuba okareeba obusaasi bwangye,
Waamanya enaku zangye,

Ongirire embabazi, ai MUKAMA, ahakuba nyine obusaasi;
Eriisho ringwire omunda,
Amagara gangye n'omubiri gwangye binyangaraire ahabw'obusaasi.

Eego, nimpurira baingi nibambeiherera;
Obwoba bunturukire embaju zoona,
Nibangiira omu naama, kusherura obwengye bw'okuunyita.

Nkagambisa obwoba nti:
Ncwirwe omu maisho gaawe;
Kwonka ku naakutakiire, waahurira okweshengyereza kwangye.

35:
Nk'orikusaasibwa munywani we nari mwene ishe;
Naagyendagyenda nk'orikucurira nyina,
Nyinami n'amaganya maingi.

Kwonka nyowe, ku naagwire, baayesiima,
Baayeteerana kundwanisa;
N'abataine ku bari, abu naabaire ntarikumanya,
Baaguma nibannyaanyaata;

Oncwere orubanja, ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye,
Nk'okuhikiirira kwawe oku kuri;
Otabareka kuunyehimbisizaho.

37:
Huumurira omuri MUKAMA, omutegyereze n'okugumisiriza;
Oteemereza omutima ahabw'omuntu orikuhiirwa omu muhanda gwawe,
Akahikiiriza enaama ze embi.

Kwonka ababi baryahwerekyerera,
Abazigu ba MUKAMA baryaba nk'obunyaatsi burungi obw'omu iriisizo;
Baryahwerekyerera, bahweho nk'omwika.

Nkaba ndi omutisgazi, mbwenu ndi omurugurusi;
Kwonka tinkareebaga ohikiriire atsigirweho,
N'obu baakuba abaana be nibashaba ak'okurya.

Tegyereza MUKAMA, ogume omu muhanda gwe;
Niwe arikutunguura, okahungura ensi;
Oryareeba okuhwerekyerera kw'abasiisi.

MUKAMA abahwera, kandi abakiza;
Abaiha omu mikono y'ababi, kandi abajuna,
Ahabw'okuba bamuhungiraho.

38:
Kandi abarikwenda kuunyita nibantega emitego;
N'abarikwenda kunkora kubi nibagamba eby'okumpwerekyereza,
Kandi bateekateeka eby'okundeebya eizooba ryona.

39:
Nkagira nti: Ndyarinda emitwarize yangye,
Ndekye kushiisha n'orurimi rwangye;
Kandi ndyabumba akanwa kangye, omubi akiri omu maisho gangye.

Omutima gwangye gwabugumwamu omuriro;
Ku naateekateekire, gwayaka,
Ahonaaho naagamba.

MUKAMA, ommanyise omuheru gwangye,
N'obunaku bw'ebiro byangye oku burikwingana;
Ommanyise ku ndi ow'okuhwaho juba.

Reeba, ohindwire ebiro byangye nk'ebita bikye,
N'emyaka yangye omu maisho gaawe ni busha;
buzimazima omuntu weena, n'obu yaakuba agumire ata, n'omwitsyo.

Buzima omuntu weena agyenda ari nk'ekinyimanyimi,
Buzima bahendekyera busha;
Omuntu ashanguruza ebintu, atarikumanya oribitwara.

40:
Yaanyiha omu kiina ky'okuhwerekyereramu omu byondo;
Yaayemereza ebigyere byangye aha rukiri,
Yaahamya entegye zangye;

Ebitambo n'empongano tobishemerererwa;
Amatu gangye ogaigwire;
Ebitambo eby'okwokyeza kimwe n'ebitambo by'ebibi torabyenzire;

Mbuuriire eby'okuhikiirira omu mutwe muhango gw'abantu;
Reebam tindekire kugamba;
Naiwe nookimanya, ai MUKAMA.

Tinsherekire by'okuhikiirira kwawe omu mutima gwangye;
Ngambire eby'okwesigwa kwawe n'okujuna kwawe;
Embabazi zaawe n'amazima gaawe timbisherekire mutwe muhango gw'abantu.

Ahakuba obubi bwingi obuhinguraine bunyehinguririize;
Eby'okutahikiirira byangye bimpikireho,
Byanzibira kwimutsya amaisho;
Ni bingi okukira eishokye ry'aha mutwe gwangye;
Omutima gwampwa omunda.

Abarikwenda kuhwerekyereza amagara gangye
Bakwatwe enshoni, boona bashoberwe;
Abarikwesiimira enaku zangye, bagarurwe enyima, bagaywe.

Boona abakusherura bashemererwe, bananukire omuriiwe;
Abarikukunda okujuna kwawe bagume bagire bati:
MUKAMA aheebwe ekitiinisa!

41:
MUKAMA aryamurinda, agume ari ohuriire;
Kandi aryaheebwa omugisha akiri omu nsi.
Otamurekurira abazigu be kumukora nk'oku barikwenda.

Ku aija kundeeba, ayegambagambisa ebitaine mugahso;
Haza obwo omutima gwe nigushaguruza orukuru;
Ngu ku araashohore, arubuzy.

42:
Ai Ruhanga wangye, amagara gangye geehweire amatsiko;
Nikyo ndikwijukira, ndi omu nsi ya Yorudani na Herumooni,
N'aha kabungo ka Mizaari.

43:
Obwo nibwo ndaaze aha itambiro rya Ruhanga,
Ahari Ruhanga okushemererwa kwangye okwingi munonga;
Kandi ndyakuhimbisa n'enanga, ai Ruhanga, Ruhanga wangye.

44:
liAi Ruhanga, tukeehuririra n'amatu gaitu,
Baatatenkuriitwe baatugambira,
Ebi waakozire omu bunaku bwabo omu biro ebya ira;

Ahakuba rurara yaabo tiyo yaabakubwize ensi,
Kandi n'omukono gwabo tigwo gwabajunire;
Kureka omukono gwawe gwa buryo n'amaani gaawe,
N'omushana gw'amaisho gaawe;
Ahakuba okabeekundira.

45:
Omutima gwangye gwijwire ebigambo birungi nibisheesheka;
Ningamba ebigambo ebi naahimbiire omugabe;
Orurimi rwangye n'ekaraamu y'omuhandiiki orikurahutsya.

Ori murungi noohita abaana b'abantu;
Oburungi bushukirwe aha minwa yaawe.
Nikyo Ruhanga akuheereire omugisha ebiro n'ebiro.

Emyambi yaawe eine obwogi
Omu mitima y'abazigu b'omugabe;
Amahanga nigagwa omu maisho gaawe.

Okakunda okuhikiirira, waayanga obubi;
Nikyo Ruhanga, Ruhanga waawe, yaakushukiireho amajuta
G'okushemererwa okukira bagyenzi baawe.

Ebijwaro byawe byona nibitaamirana omugaju
Gwa sumuruna, obunyanunga n'omudarasiini;
Enanga ezirikuteererwa omu bikaari ebihunzire emiino nizikushemeza.

46:
Amaraho engamba okuhika aha muheru gw'ensi;
Ahenda amata, amacumu agatemamu kabiri;
N'ebigaari abyotsya n'omuriro.

48:
Mwetegyereze orugo rwarwo, oku ruzitiire;
Mumanye ebikaari byarwo,
Mureebe oku muribiteekyerereza ab'obusingye oburiija.

49:
Eego, areeba abanyabwengye nibafa;
Omushema n'ekituuriizi boona bahwerekyerera,
Batsigira abandi eitungo ryabo.

Bateekateeka ngu amaka gaabo garyagumaho ebiro byona,
Kandi ngu obutaaho bwabo buryagumaho okuhitsya obusingye bwona;
N'ebibanja byabo bigume nibibeetererwa.

Bafunywa nk'obusyo bw'entaama, nibaza Okuzimu;
Rufu n'omuriisa waabo kandi omutegyeki waabo.
Oburungi bwabo buryahwaho;
Kandi Okuzimu eryaba eka yaabo.

50:
Ruhanga waitu naija, taryetsiza;
Omuriro ogurikwokyeza kimwe gumwebembeire,
Ayehinguririziibwe eihunga ry'amaani;

Muhurire, imwe abantu bangye, ngambe;
Hurira, Israeli, nkuhamize.
Niinye Ruhanga, Ruhanga waawe.

Ebyo byona okabikora, naakwetsiza;
Waateekateeka ngu niinyinganira kimwe naiwe,
Kwonka ndyakuhana, mbikuratanise omu maisho gaawe.

51:
Obwo nibwo orishemerererwa ebitambo ebihikire,
N'ebitambo ebyokize, n'ebitambo ebyokyeize kimwe;
Haza nibwo enimi zirihongyerwa aha itambiro ryawe.

52:
Naiwe nikwo Ruhanga arikuhwerekyereza ebiro byona;
Aryakukwata n'amaani, akuhuruuture omu ihema ryawe,
Akurandure omu nsi y'abahuriire.

53:
Omushema agira omu mutima gwe ati:
Ruhanga tabaho;
Basiisikaire, nibakora ebihagaro;
Tihariho n'omwe orikukora gye.

54:
Ahakuba abanyamaryo baanyimukiriire,
Abataine saasi nibacwa obwengye oku baraanyite;
Tibeeteire hari Ruhanga.

Ndyakuhongyera ekitambo nyihire aha mutima;
Ndyasingiza eiziina ryawe, ai MUKAMA,
Ahakuba ni rirungi.

55:
Kwonka owanjumire akaba atari muzigu wangye;
Kandi owaanyekunikireho akaba atari mubisha,
Nkaamwesherekire;

Ka rufu ebagweho;
Bashuume okuzimu bahuriire;
Ahakuba obubi buri omuribo n'omu maka gaabo.

Aryajuna amagara gangye,
Ankize abarikuunyirira haihi kundwanisa;
Ahakuba abarikundwanisa ni baingi.

Yegyekyerera MUKAMA omutwaro gwawe,
Nawe aryaguma naakukwatirira;
Tariikiriza ohikiriire kutengyetsibwa.

Kwonka Iwe, Ruhanga, oryabanaga omu kiina ky'okuhwerekyerereramu;
Abaitsi n'engobya baryafa batakahikize kicweka ky'emyaka yaabo;
Kwonka nyowe ndyaguma nkwesigye. s

56:
Ngirira embabazi, ai Ruhanga,
Ahakuba abantu nibenda kummira;
Eizooba ryona nibandwanisa, nibaanyita kubi.

Ruhanga aryampa okusiima ekigambo kye;
Ruhanga niwe ndikwesiga; tinditiina;
Abantu-buntu nibabaasa kunkora ki?

Beeteerana hamwe, beesherekire;
Nibareebereza ahu ndikuraba.
Nk'oku baagwereire amagara gangye,

Niiwe omanya okuzengyerera kwangye;
Ote amarira gangye omu cupa yaawe.
Tigarahandiikirwe omu kitabo kyawe?

57:
Aryayema omu iguru, anjune;
Aryahemura abarikwenda kummira.
Ruhanga aryayohereza embabazi ze n'amazima ge.

Bategire ebigyere byangye omutego;
Omutima gwangye gucuramiriirwe;
Batimbire obusya ahu ndikuraba;
Kwonka baaba nibo baabugwamu.

Omutima gwangye gugumire, ai Ruhanga,
Omutima gwangye gugumire;
Ndyayeshongora; eego, ndyayeshongora eby'okuhimbisa!

58:
Ekirirugamu, abantu baryagira bati:
Buzimazima hariho ebihembo by'abahikiriire;
Buzimazima hariho Ruhanga ocwa emanja omu nsi.

59:
Ahakuba bagwereire amagara gangye;
Amamanzi geeteeraine kundwanisa,
Ntaine kibi kyona, n'obu kyakuba eki nsiisire.

Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli,
Imuka ohane abanyamahanga boona;
Otasaasira omunyabibi weena orikureebya.

Reeba, bakankama n'akanwa kaabo;
Basinikire amaino,
Ahakuba bagira bati: Ebyo hariho orikutuhurira?

Otabaita, abantu bangye barekye kwebwa;
Obatetemye n'amaani gaawe,
Obacwe amaryo, ai Mukama engabo yaitu.

60:
Gileadi n'eyangye; na Manaase nayo n'eyangye;
Efuraimu n'enkofiira y'okundinda;
Yuda n'enkoni yangye ey'obukama.

Moabu n'ekinaabiro kyangye;
Edomu niho nnaga enkaito yangye;
Filistia niho nteerera akaari k'okusingura.

61:
Ku ndiba ndi aha muheru gw'ensi, omutima gwangye gwagwa enshazi,
Ndyaguma nkutakire;
Ompitsye aha mutwe gw'orukiri, ahu ntarikubaasa kwehitsya.

62:
Imwe abantu, mumwesigye buri kaanya;
Mumugambire byona, mumare omu kashansha;
Ruhanga n'obuhungiro bwaitu.

Abantu abataine kitiinisa baba omwityo kwonka;
N'abaine ekitiinisa ni busha;
Ku bateebwa aha minzaani, ebaimutsya;
Boona hamwe banguhi okukira omwitsyo.

Mutaryesiga okuhata abandi;
Mutarigira amatsiko ga busha aha kunyaga.
Eitungo ku ririkanya, mutariritaho omutima.

63:
Kwonka omugabe aryashemerererwa omuri Ruhanga;
Weena orikumurahira aryayesiima;
ahakuba akanwa k'ababeihi karyaigarwa.

64:
Beegumiza omu naama zaabo mbi;
Bahanuura kutega emitego omu mubonano,
Nibagira bati: N'oha orikwija kutureeba?

66:
Akahindura enyanja ensi eyomire,
Abantu baaraba omu mugyera n'ebigyere;
Okwo niyo twamusiimiire munonga.

Ategyekyesa obushoboorozi ebiro byona;
Amaisho ge agatuuza aha mahanga.
Abagomi beerinde, barekye kwetunguura.

Waikiriza abantu kuturibatiirira, batembire embaraasi;
Tukaraba omu muriro n'omu maizi,
Kwonka waatuhitsya omu mwanya ogwine obweshanziro.

67:
Amahanga geesiime, geeshongore ahabw'okushemererwa;
Ahabw'okuba ocwera abantu emanja omu bwinganisa,
Kandi oyebembera amahanga agari omu nsi.

68:
Obatuntumure nk'omwika;
Ababi bahwerekyererere omu maisho ga Ruhanga,
Nk'oku entsinda eyagira aha muriro;

Kwonka abahikiriire bo bananukye;
Beesime munonga omu maisho ge;
Eego, bashemererwe n'okunanuka.

Mweshongorere Ruhanga, mweshongore eby'okuhimbisa eiziina rye;
Mwimutsye amaraka, mweshongorere Ogwo ogyendera aha bicu;
Eiziina rye ni Yehova; mwesiimire munonga omu maisho ge!

Ruhanga aha amaka abataine ifo na ruguru;
Abohoorora embohe, ngu zitungye ebirungi,
Kwonka abagomi batuura omu nsi eyomire.

Ebigaari bya Ruhanga n'obukumi bubiri,
Enkumi n'enkumi;
Mukama akaija omu Mwanya ogurikwera, naaruga Sinai.

Hana n'amaani enyamaishwa z'omu rufunjo,
Eigana ry'enimi n'enyana z'amahanga;
Oribatiirire abantu abaine omururu gw'okutoijesa agandi mahanga;
Otaataanise amahanga agakunda kurwana.

Mugambe ku Ruhanga aine amaani;
Ategyeka Israeli omu kitiinisa ky'obukama bwe,
Kandi amaani ge gari omu bicu.

Ruhanga n'Ow'okutiinisa omu Mwanya gwe ogurikwera;
Ruhanga wa Israeli niwe aha abantu be obushoboorozi n'amaani.
Ruhanga asiimwe!

69:
Abarikuunyangira busha ni baingi okukira eishokye ry'aha mutwe gwangye;
Abazigu bangye abarikwenda kuunyitira busha n'ab'amaani.
Nshemereire kuriha ebi ntaraibire?

Ahabw'okuhwera kwawe okurikwesigwa onjune,
Ntashaayira omu byondo;
Nkire abarikuunyanga, kandi ndugye omu maizi maraingwa.

Otaikiriza omwegyemure kuntwara,
N'obu kwakuba okumirirwa ahagati y'amaizi maingi;
Kandi otaikiriza Ekiina kunkingirana omu kanwa kaakyo.

Ebijumo bincwire omutima, ninshaasha munonga;
Nsherwire ow'okunsaasira, yaabura;
Kandi naasherura ab'okumpuumuriza, nabo bamburira.

Ahakuba Ruhanga aryajuna Saayuuni,
Agarukye ayombekye endembo za Yuda,
Abantu be baryagituuramu, ebe eyaabo;

70:
Abarikwenda kuunyita
Bahemurwe, bashoberwe;
N'abarikwesiima naakorwa kubi bagarurwe enyima, bagaywe.

Kwonka ndi omworo kandi omukyene;
Rahuka kumpikaho, ai Ruhanga;
Niiwe Muhwezi wangye, kandi Omujuni wangye;
Ai MUKAMA otaikarayo!

71:
Niiwe nyegamira okwiha obu naazaarwa;
Niiwe waanyihire omu nda ya maawe.
Niiwe ndiguma nimpimbisa.

Nibagira bati: Ruhanga amutsigireho;
Mumukurate, mumukwate;
Ahakuba taine kijuna.

Akanwa kangye karyamanyisa eby'okuhikiirira kwawe,
N'eby'okujuna kwawe eizooba ryona;
ahakuba ni bingi, tindikubaasa kubibara.

Iwe owaanyikiriize nkareeba enaku nyingi,
Oryagaruka, ompe amagara;
Onzoore, onyihe okuzimu.

72:
Aryagumaho; kandi baryamureetera ezaabu ya Sheeba;
N'abantu baryaguma nibamushabira,
Bamushabire omugisha eizooba ryona.

Eiziina rye riryagumaho ebiro byona,
N'okurangaanwa kwe kuryagumaho, eizooba ku ririba rikiriho;
Kandi omuriwe abantu boona nimwo bariheerwa omugisha;
Amahanga goona garyamweta Oine omugisha.

Kandi eiziina rye ery'ekitiinisa risiimwe ebiro byona;
Ekitiinisa kye kiijure ensi yoona.
Amiina, kandi Amiina!

73:
Kwonka ekirungi ahariinye n'okwirira haihi Ruhanga;
Mukama RUHANGA mmuhindwire obweshereko bwangye,
Mbone kumanyisa abantu ebi waakozire byona.

74:
Titukireeba bumanyiso bwaitu;
Tihaakiriho nabi n'omwe,
Kandi tihariho n'omwe ahariitwe orikumanya ahi ebi birigarukira.

75:
Nitukusiima, ai Ruhanga; nitukusiima;
ahakuba eiziina ryawe riri haihi;
Abantu nibagamba eby'okutangaaza ebi waakozire.

76:
Ohigye Ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, kandi ohikiirize okuhiga kwawe;
Boona abamwehinguririize bareete emitoijo
ahari Ogwo oshemereire kutiinwa,

77:
Aha izooba eri naareebeireho enaku, nkasherura Mukama;
Naimutsya emikono yangye nyekiro, tinaaruha;
amagara gangye gaayanga kuhuumuzibwa.

Bwanyima naagira nti:
Ebyo nibiruga omu bweremwa bwangye;
Okuteekateeka ngu omukono gwa buryo ogwa Rukira-boona niguginduka!

Eiraka ry'okuhinda kwawe ryaizira omu kasooroora;
Emirabyo yaawe yaamurika ensi yoona;
Ensi yaatetema, yaatengyeta.

Omuhanda gwawe gukaba guri omu nyanja,
N'otuhanda twawe nituraba omu maizi maingi;
Ahi ebigyere byawe byarabire, tiharamanyirwe.

78:
N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA ku yaakihuriire, yaakwatwa ekiniga;
Omuriro gwahembwa kwotsya Yakobo,
Ekiniga kyacumbuukira Israeli;

Yaabingamu amahanga, gaabahunga;
Yaagibabaganisiza kuba obuhunguzi bwabo,
Yaata enganda za Israeli omu mahema gaabo.

79:
Otaijuka eby'okutahikiirira bya baatatenkuriitwe, okabitutura;
Okusaasira kwawe kurahukye kutuhikaho,
Ahabw'okuba tugarwirwe ahansi munonga.

Ai Ruhanga ow'okujunwa kwaitu, otuhwere
Ahabw'ekitiinisa ky'eiziina ryawe;
Otujune, oshwekye ebibi byaitu ahabw'eiziina ryawe.

81:
Ku mwatakire muri omu busaasi, naabakiza;
Naabagarukamu ndi omu mwanya gw'enkuba ogutarikumanywa;
Naabagyereza aha maizi ga Meriba. Sela.

Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe,
Owaakwihire omu nsi ya Misri;
Yashamya munonga akanwa kaawe, nkaijuze.

82:
Tibaine ki barikumanya, n'obu kwakuba okwetegyereza;
Bagyendagyendera omu mwirima;
Emisingi y'ensi yoona etengyetsibwa.

84:
Amagara gangye nigeetenga kureeba ebikaari byawe, ai MUKAMA,
Nangwa kigareeteire n'okugwa enshazi;
Omutima gwangye n'omubiri gwangye nibitakira Ruhanga ohuriire.

Ku baba nibaraba omu ruhanga rw'amarira,
Baruhindura omwanya gw'enshuro z'amaizi;
Kandi enjura y'empangukano erushweka emigisha.

Ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga niwe izooba kandi engabo;
MUKAMA aha embabazi n'ekitiinisa;
Taine kirungi kyona eki aima abagyendera omu mazima.

85:
Ka mpurire ebi Ruhanga MUKAMA araagambe,
Ahakuba naija kugambira abantu be n'abarikwera be eby'obusingye;
Kwonka barekye kugaruka omu bushema.

86:
Ompindukire, onsaasire;
Ohe omwiru waawe amaani gaawe,
Kandi ojune omwana w'omuzaana waawe.

Onyorekye akamanyiso akarikuhamaya ku onkunda,
Abarikuunyanga bakireebe, bahemukye;
Ahakuba MUKAMA, niiwe ompwereire, okampuumuza omutima.

87:
Ahari abo abarikummanya ndyagamba ahari Rahabu na Babulooni;
Reeba Filistia na Tuuro hamwe na Esiopia;
Ogu niyo yaazaariirwe.

88:
Oreeteire abamanyi kuunyetantara,
Wampindura eki barikunuga;
Nkingirainwe, tindikubaasa kushohora.

89:
Ndyayeshongora eby'embabazi za MUKAMA ebiro byona;
Ndyaguma niinyeshongora eby'embabazi zaawe, ai MUKAMA,
Mmanyise ab'obusingye bwona okwesigwa kwawe n'akanwa kangye.

Omu bunaku obwa ira okagambira abarikwera baawe omu kworekwa oti:
Njwekire ow'amaani ekirunga;
Ntungwire owaatoorainwe omu bantu.

90:
Obatwarira kimwe, nk'abarikutwarwa omwegyemure;
Bari nk'abagwejegyeire;
Omu kasheeshe baba nk'obunyaatsi oburikumera;

Emyaka y'amagara gaitu eba makumi mushanju,
Nari ku tuba twagizire amaani, ehika makumi munaana;
Kwonka okugyogamu n'okufa kubi n'okureeba enaku;
ahakuba erahuka kuhwaho, naitwe twegyendera.

Embabazi za Mukama Ruhanga waitu zigume ahariitwe,
Ohamye omurimo gw'emikono yaitu;
Eego, omurimo gw'emikono yaitu;
Eego, omurimo gw'emikono yaitu oguhamye.

91:
Aryakushweka amoya ge,
Ahansi y'amapapa ge niho orishanga obuhungiro;
Amazima ge n'engabo n'akagabo.

Abantu rukumi bakaagwa aha rubaju rwawe,
Na kakumi bagwa aha rubaju rwawe rwa buryo,
Kwonka iwe torihikwaho;

Ku arintakira, ndyamugarukamu;
Ndyaguma nawe omu naku;
Ndyamujuna, mmuhe ekitiinisa;

93:
MUKAMA ari aha ngoma; ajwaire ekitiinisa;
MUKAMA ajwaire, ayezirikire amaani;
Eego, ensi ehamire; terikubaasa kutengyetsibwa.

Emyegyemure ehooreire, ai MUKAMA;
Emyegyemure ehooreire n'amaraka gaayo;
Emyegyemure eborogotsire munonga.

94:
Aryabagaruraho okutahikiirira kwabo,
Abamarireho kimwe ahabw'obubi bwabo;
MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu aryabamariraho kimwe.

96:
Mugambire omu mahanga muti: MUKAMA ari aha ngoma!
Eego, ensi ehamire; terikubaasa kutengyetsibwa;
Aryacwera amahanga emanja z'oburyo.

97:
Saayuuni ekabihurira, yaashemererwa,
N'abaishiki ba Yuda baayesiima
Ahabw'emicwere yaawe, ai Ruhanga;

98:
Omu maisho ga MUKAMA; ahakuba naija kutegyeka ensi;
Aryacwera ensi emanja omu kuhikiirira,
N'amahanga omu bwinganisa.

99:
Omukama okunda eby'oburyo!
Niiwe otaho obwinganisa omu bantu;
Okacwa emanja z'oburyo n'okuhikiirira omuri Yakobo.

Muhimbise MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu;
Mumuramize omu maisho g'akatebe k'ebigyere bye,
Nimugira muti: N'Orikwera!

Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, okaba obagarukamu;
Okaba ori Ruhanga orikubasaasira,
N'obu oraabe waabahoire enzigu ahabw'ebibi ebi baakozire.

101:
Tindigira kintu kyona ekibi eki naayebembeza;
Niinyangira kimwe ekirikukorwa abarikuteishuka omuhanda gwawe;
Tindikwatanisa nakyo.

102:
Otaanyima amaisho aha izooba ry'obusaasi bwangye,
Ontegye okutu kwawe,
Orahukye kungarukamu aha izooba eri ndaakutakirireho;

Oryaimuka osaasire Saayuuni;
Ahakuba nibwo bunaku bw'okugigirira embabazi;
Eego, obunaku obwatairweho buhikire.

Ebyo biryahwaho, kwonka Iwe oryagumaho;
Eego, ebyo byona biryakura nk'ekijwaro,
Oryabihindura nk'omwenda, bihindukye okundi;

104:
Singiza MUKAMA, iwe magara gangye!
Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye, ori mukuru munonga;
Ojwaire ekitiinisa n'obukuru.

Waataho enyomyo z'ekishengye kyawe omu maizi;
Ebicu waabigira ekigaari kyawe,
Noogyenda aha mapapa g'omuyaga.

Ku obiima amaisho, bishoberwa;
Ku obiihamu omwitsyo, bifa.
Bigaruka omu mucuucu omu byarugire.

106:
Haleluya;
Musiime MUKAMA, ahabw'okuba ni murungi;
Kandi embabazi ze n'ez'ebiro n'ebiro.

Baatatenkuriitwe tibareetegyereize by'okutangaaza ebi waakozire omuri Misri;
Tibaraijukire by'embabazi bingi ebi waakozire,
Kureka bakagomera Rukira-boona aha Nyanja erikutukura.

N'ahabw'ekyo yaabahayira ku arikwija kubahwerekyereza;
Akaabaire yaabaherizeho, kuri Musa ou yaatooraine ataramwemereire mumaisho ahasheenyukire
Kutuubya ekiniga kye, ngu atakaabacwekyereza.

Kaingi akaba abakiza;
Kwonka bamugomera omu naama zaabo,
N'okutahikiirira kwabo kubagarura ahansi.

108:
Gileadi n'eyangye; na Manaase nayo n'eyangye;
Efuraimu n'enkofiira y'okundinda;
Yuda n'enkon yangye ey'obukama.

Moabu n'ekinaabiro kyangye;
Edomu niho nnaga enkaito yangye;
Filistia niho nteerera akaari k'obusinguzi.

109:
Bo ka bakyeene, kwonka Iwe ohe omugisha;
Ku baraimukye, bakwatwe enshoni;
Kwonka omwiru waawe ashemererwe!

111:
Akatwekyera abantu be eky'okubacungura;
Yaataho endagaano ye kuba ey'ebiro byona;
Eiziina rye niryera kandi n'ery'okutiinwa.

Omu kutiina MUKAMA nimwo obwengye bukomooka;
Boona abakugyenderamu baine okwetegyereza kurungi.
Okuhimbisibwa kwe n'okw'ebiro byona.

112:
Akagabisa obufura, yaagabira abooro;
Okuhikiirira kwe nikugumaho ebiro byona;
Eihembe rye riryatunguurwa n'ekitiinisa.

Omubi aryakireeba, aguubwe kubi;
Aryanena enshaya, ahwereho kimwe;
Eki omubi ayetenga kiryabura.

115:
Bigira engaro, tibikwata;
Bigira ebigyere, tibigyenda;
Kandi tibigambisa mimiro yaabyo.

MUKAMA atwijukire, aryatuha omugisha;
Aryaha enju ya Israeli omugisha,
Aryaha enju ya Arooni omugisha;

116:
Emitego ya rufu ekanzingazinga,
N'obuhuruzi bw'okuzimu bwankwata;
Naareeba enaku n'obusaasi.

118:
Bampumbatsi nk'enjoki,
Nibabuguma nk'omuriro gw'amahwa;
Omu iziina rya MUKAMA ndyabahwerekyereza.

Eiraka ry'okushemererwa ahabw'okujunwa
Nirihurirwa omu mahema g'abahikiriire;
Omukono gwa buryo gwa MUKAMA gukora eby'obumanzi.

127:
Muhendekyera busha okwimuka kare, mukakyerererwa kubyama,
Kandi mukarya eby'okurya ebi muhendekyeire;
Haza ebyo abiha abu akunda, beegwejegyereire.

130:
Iwe Israeli, ta amatsiko gaawe ahari MUKAMA,
Ahakuba ahari MUKAMA hariho embabazi ezitahinduka;
Kandi ahariwe hariho okucungurwa kwingi;

131:
Buzimazima ncureize omutima gwangye, naaguhunamya,
Nk'omwana ou nyina yaarembesereza, akamuha akabeere;
Omutima gwangye guri nk'omwana owaarembeserezibwa.

132:
MUKAMA akarahira Daudi omu mazima; tariita ndahiro;
Naagira ati: Ndyayemeka omwe aha baana b'enda yaawe
Arye engoma yaawe.

133:
Nk'orume rwa Herumooni oruragarika aha bibungo bya Saayuuni;
Ahakuba aho niho MUKAMA yaaragiire ngu hagire omugisha,
Nigo magara ag'ebiro n'ebiro.

135:
Haleluya!
Muhimbise eiziina rya MUKAMA;
Imwe abairu ba MUKAMA, mumuhimbise!

Niwe aimutsya ebicu aha mbaju zoona ez'ensi;
Akareeta emirabyo ahabw'enjura;
Akashohoza omuyaga okuruga omu mabiikiro ge.

138:
Ndyaramya, mpindukiire ei hekalu yaawe erikwera eri,
Nsiime eiziina ryawe ahabw'embabazi zaawe ezitahinduka n'ahabw'amazima gaawe;
Ahabw'okuba okaha ekigambo kyawe ekitiinisa okukira ebindi byona.

Mumanye ngu MUKAMA, n'obu araabe ari ahaiguru munonga,
Ata omutima aha bacureezi;
Kwonka ab'amaryo abamanyira hare.

MUKAMA aryahikiiriza byona ebi yanteekateekyeire;
Embabazi zaawe, ai MUKAMA, n'ez'ebiro byona;
Otareka ebi waayekoreire n'emikono yaawe.

139:
Omwirima nagwo tigwine ki gukushereka;
Ahakuba ekiro kihweza nka nyomushana;
Omwirima n'omushana nikyo kimwe ahariiwe.

Ninkuhimbisa ahabw'okumpanga omu muringo gw'eihano kandi ogurikutangaaza;
Ebi waakozire n'eby'okutangaaza,
Kandi eby'omu mutima gwangye noobimanya gye buzima.

Amaisho gaawe gakaba gandeebera omu nda, nkiri amaizi;
Omu kitabo kyawe hahandiikirwemu ebiro byangye byona,
Nk'oku byaragiirwe, hatakabaireho na kimwe.

140:
Ab'amaryo bantegire omutego n'emigoye;
Bategire ekigoye aha muhanda,
Bantega orugogo.Sela

141:
Omuntu murungi anteere nari ampane n'embabazi;
Kwonka amajuta g'omubi gatarishukwa aha mutwe gwangye;
Ahakuba obutoosha nshaba nindwanisa emicwe yaabo emibi.

142:
Naareeba aha rubaju rwangye rwa buryo,
Kwonka naashanga hatariho orikuunyetaho;
Ntakiine h'okuhungira, hataine orikuntaho omutima.

143:
Noomanya ngu omuzigu wangye ampiigire,
Yaateera amagara gangye ahansi;
Yanshutamya omu kizima, nk'abaafiire ira.

Nkutegire emikono;
Omutima gwangye gukwiniire eiriho, nk'ori omu nsi eyomire.
Sera

Onyegyese kukora ebi okunda,
Ahakuba niiwe Ruhanga wangye;
Omwoyo waawe omurungi anyebembere omu muhanda oguringaniire.

Ahabw'embabazi zaawe ezitahinduka cwekyereza abazigu bangye;
Kandi omareho boona abarikubonabonesa amagara gangye;
Ahabw'okuba ndi omwiru waawe.

144:
Niwe rukiri rwangye, n'orugo rwangye orugumire;
Omunaara gwangye omuraingwa, kandi omujuni wangye;
Engabo yangye, kandi ou nyesiga,
Ongomoorera abantu bangye.

Gorora omukono gwawe nooyema ahaiguru;
Onjune, onyihe omu maizi maingi,
Omu mikono y'abanyamahanga;

Ente zaitu zihaka, zireka kutorooga;
Hareka kugira abaasheenya orugo, bakataaha,
Nari abaashohora kuza kurwana;
N'obu kwakuba okuboroogyera omu bihandagazi byaitu!

146:
Ocwera abarikubonabonesibwa emanja z'oburyo;
Oha abaine enjara eby'okurya.
MUKAMA akomorora embohe;

MUKAMA ahumuura empumi;
MUKAMA aimutsya abeyinamiriire;
MUKAMA akunda abahikiriire.

MUKAMA aryategyeka ebiro byona;
Iwe Saayuni, Ruhanga waawe aryategyeka okuhitsya obusingye bwona.
Haleluya!

147:
Haleluya!
Ahakuba ni kirungi okweshongorera Ruhanga waitu eby'okuhimbisa;
Ahabw'okuba n'ow'embabazi, kandi okuhimbisa kuhikire.

Tihariho ihanga erindi ryona eri aragizire atyo;
Kandi n'emicwere ye tibakagimanyaga.
Haleluya!

148:
Bihimbise eiziina rya MUKAMA;
Ahakuba eiziina rye wenka niryo rihimbisibwa;
Ekitiinisa kye nikyeshumba ensi n'eiguru.

Aimukize eihembe ahabw'abantu be, eririkuhimbisibwa abarikwera be boona;
Nibo baana ba Israeli, eihanga erimuri haihi.
Haleluya!

150:
Haleluya!
Muhimbisize Ruhanga omu Mwanya gwe ogurikwera;
Mumuhimbisize omu kaabunga k'amaani ge.

1:
Tubamire bahuriire, nk'oku
Okuzimu emira abantu bashugaine,
Nk'abo abashuuma omu Kiina;

Mute omutima aha kuhana kwangye;
Reeba, naaza kushuka Omwoyo wangye ahariimwe,
Mbamanyise ebigambo byangye.

3:
Otarigira mutaahi waawe oti: Irooko ogarukye;
Nyencakare nkikuhe.
Haza obwo okiine.

5:
Akubeere nk'ebuguma y'empara erikukundwa, n'ey'esirabo erikushemeza;
Amabeere ge gagume gakuhaazye,
Kandi obutoosha oshemezibwe okukunda kwe.

6:
Obwo oryatwaza oti, mwana wangye, obone kwejuna;
Ahakuba oryaba ogwire omu mikono ya mutaahi waawe;
Oryagyenda nooyehuuta, omukwate amaguru noomweshengyereza;

7:
Ahonaaho yaamukurata
Nk'ente erikuza kubaagwa,
Nk'omugwa-iraro orikutwarwa omu nkomo kuhanwa;

Okuhitsya obu omwambi gwamucumitsire omu kitugu;
Nk'oku enyonyi eiruka ekagwa omu mutego
Etarikumanya ku amagara gaayo gategirwe.

8:
Okutiina MUKAMA nikwo kwanga ebibi;
amaryo n'emyehimbiso, omuhanda gw'obubi,
N'ebigambo by'okwehabagiza nibyo nyanga.

Obwo nkaba ndi hamwe nawe, ndi omukozi mukuru;
Obutoosha niinye naabaire ndi okushemererwa kwe,
Niinyesiimira omu maisho ge buri izooba,

Ohiiriirwe n'orikuunyorobera,
Akaguma omu marembo gangye naareeba,
Ategyerereize aha biti by'emiryango yangye;

10:
Enfumu za Sulemaani.
Omwana w'obwengye ashemeza ishe;
Kwonka omwana omushema agwisa kubi nyina.

19:
Okutiina MUKAMA kureeta amagara,
Kandi okwine aryaguma amazirwe;
Tarihikwaho kabi.

20:
Omuntu okurahukwa aha rurimi, akarahira ati:
Ekintu eki n'ekirikwera! n'omutego;
Akiheza kurahira, akatsigara naayefuuza.

22:
Nooreeba omuntu orikwezirika omu murimo gwe?
Aryayemerera omu maisho g'abagabe naabaheereza;
Tariheereza bataine iziina.

24:
Omanye ngu n'obwengye nikwo buriba omu magara gaawe;
Ku oribubona, oryaba oboine ebihembo,
N'amatsiko gaawe tigariihwaho.

Banza otebeekanise ebi orikwija kukora aheeru,
Oteekateekye ekintu kyona eki orikwenda omu ishwa;
Bwanyima obone kwombeka enju yaawe.

25:
Otarirahuka kutabaariza mutaahi waawe,
Nyentsya akikusinga okaitwa enshoni,
Okabura oku waagira;

28:
Ensi ku eshobya, egira abategyeki baingi;
Kwonka ku egira abanyabwengye abaine okumanya,
Bagireetera okuguma ehamire.

Orikuhabisa ow'omutima gugororokire, akamutooza omuhanda mubi,
Aryagwa omu kiina eki atimbire;
Kwonka otaine kamogo aryahungura ebirungi.

Omuntu otukuriirwe eshagama y'ou aitsire,
K'agume ari omuhungi okuhitsya aha kufa;
Kandi hatarigira owaamuhwera.

30:
Nyihaho ebitaine mugasho n'ebishuba, obite hare;
Otampindura omworo nari omutungi,
Kureka ogume ompe eby'okurya ebinshemereire,

1:
Emigyera yoona eshuka omu nyanja,
Kwonka enyanja teijura;
Ei emigyera eza, niyo egaruka kuza.

Ekirabaireho nikyo kiriguma nikibaho;
Kandi ekirakozirwe nikyo kiriguma nikikorwa.
Tihariho kisya ahansi y'eizooba.

10:
Omushema ayongyerera ebigambo,
N'obu haraabe hataine orikumanya ebiribaho;
Kandi n'oha owaakubaasa kumugambira ebiribaho yaarugireho?

1:
Amajuta gaawe g'okwesiiga garimu omugaju,
Eiziina ryawe ni nk'amajuta agashukirwe;
Nikyo empangare zikukundira.

Nkunzi yangye, eshi ori murungi;
Buzimazima nooshemeza,
Kandi ekitanda kyaitu ni nk'obunyaatsi buto.

3:
Ku naabaire ndi aha kitanda kyangye nyekiro,
Naasherura ou omutima gwangye gukunda;
Naamusherura, kwonka tinaamureeba;

Reeba, n'engozi ya Sulemaani
Eyeehinguririziibwe abashaija b'amaani makumi mukaaga
Ab'omu mamanzi ga Israeli;

Boona bahagatiire zaarurara, n'amahano omu kurwana;
Buri muntu aine rurara aha kibero kye
Ahabw'okutiina akabi nyekiro.

4:
Eshi ori murungi, nkunzi yangye,
Buzimazima ori murungi!
amaisho gaawe ni nk'ag'enkombe omu kyetwekyerero kyawe;
Eishokye ryawe ni nk'obusyo bw'embuzi
Ezibyami omu rukiizi rw'orushozi Gileadi;

Amaino gaawe ni nk'obusyo bw'entaama ezikyemwirwe,
Ezirikuruga kwogibwa;
Zoona zigira babiri, tihaine n'emwe efiisa.

Ontwaire omutima iwe munyaanyazi, mugore wangye;
Ku ondeebeise oti eriisho, wantwara omutima
N'orukwanzi rw'omu maraka gaawe.

Eminwa yaawe, mugore wangye, neetoonya nk'omushongi;
Obwoki n'amate biri ahansi y'orurimi rwawe,
Okutaamirana kw'ebijwaro byawe ni nk'okwa Lebanooni.

5:
Nkaba ngwejegyeire, kwonka omutima gwangye nigureeba;
Naahurira eiraka rya nkunzi yangye naakongoota, naagira ati:
Nyigurira, munyaanyazi, nkunzi yangye,
Nkombe yangye, owangye oshugaine;
Ahakuba omutwe gwangye gutonzirweho orume,
N'eishokye ryangye ririmu amatondo ga nyekiro.

Naigurira nkunzi yangye;
Naashanga yaayegyendeire, atakiriho–
Kwonka obu yaabaire naagamba, omutima gukampuruutuka-
Naamusherura, yaamburira;
Naamweta, tiyaanyetaba.

Abarinzi abaabaire bagyendagyenda omu rurembo
Bambugana, banteera, bamputaaza;
Abarinzi b'orugo rwarwo baanyaka omunagiro gwangye.

6:
Nyihaho amaisho, ahakuba gankozire kubi;
Eishokye ryawe ni nk'obusyo bw'embuzi
Ezibyami omu rukiizi rwa Gileadi;

Amaino gaawe ni nk'obusyo bw'entaama
Ezirikuruga kwogibwa,
Zoona zigira babiri, tihaine n'emwe efiisa;

7:
Ekishoroshoro kyawe ni nk'ekikopo
Ekitakooshaga viinyo ejwangize;
Enda yaawe ni nk'ekirundo ky'engano
Ekyehinguririziibwe emyangangye;

Ebitsya byawe ni nk'omunaara gw'emiino y'enjojo;
Amaisho gaawe ni nk'ebiyanja bya Heshibooni
Ebiri aha irembo rya Batirabiimu;
Enyindo yaawe ni nk'omunaara gwa Lebanooni
Ogurikureeba Damasiko;

Omutwe gwawe ni nka Karumeeli;
Eishokye ryawe ni nk'omwenda gwa bujwa,
Omugabe akwatwa obutsibo bwaryo nk'enkwatwa.

8:
Onte aha mutima gwawe nk'akamanyiso,
Kandi onte n'aha mukono gwawe;
Ahabw'okuba rukundo n'ey'amaani nka rufu,
Kandi okufuuha tikusaasira, ni nk'ekituuro;
Endimi zaakwo nizityankana nk'ez'omuriro,
Nk'ez'omuriro ogurikurya busha.

Nyowe nkaba ndi orugo rw'amabaare;
N'amabeere gangye gari nk'eminaara
Okuruga obwo naagira obusingye omu maisho ge.

Iwe otuura omu misiri,
Bagyenzi bangye nibenda kuhurira ebi orikugamba;
Naanye ka mbihurire.

1:
Mutagaruka kundeetera empongano ezitaine mugasho;
Obubaane n'ekirikunugwa ahariinye;
Okuboneka kw'ameezi, na zaasabato, n'okutaho enteerane–
Tindikubaasa kugumisiririza kutahikiirira hamwe n'okuteerana okurikwera.

Amagyenyi gaanyu ag'okuboneka kw'okwezi, n'agandi agaatairweho,
omutima gwangye nigugangira kimwe;
Gankabize; okugagumisiririza kunduhize.

Ku muritega emikono yaanyu, ndyabaima amaisho;
Nangwa n'obu muriguma nimushaba hakye-hakye, tindibahurira;
Ahabw'okuba engaro zaanyu ziijwire eshagama.

Mwogye, mweboneze,
Mwiheho obubi bw'emicwe yaanyu omu maisho gangye;
Murekye kukora kubi,

MUKAMA naagira ati: Mbwenu nimwije tuhanuure hamwe;
Ebibi byanyu n'obu biraabe nibitukura nka karari,
Biryayera nk'orubaare;
N'obu biraabe nibitukura tuku-tuku,
Biryaba nk'ebyoya by'entaama ebirikwera.

Kwonka ku muraayangye, mukagoma,
Muryariibwa rurara;
Ahabw'okuba akanwa ka MUKAMA niko kaakigamba.

2:
Aryacwera amahanga emanja,
Aramure enganda nyingi;
Obwo zaarurara zaabo baryaziheeshamu amafuka,
N'amacumu gaabo bagaheeshemu empabyo;
Eihanga tiriribangira rindi rurara,
Kandi tibarigaruka kwega by'engamba.

Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ow'amahe aine ekiro
Eki arirwanisizaho eby'amaryo n'ebirikwekuza byona
N'ekintu kyona ekirikwetunguura;
Kandi byona biryagarurwa ahansi;

Kandi emyekuniko y'omuntu eryacureezibwa,
N'amaryo g'abantu garyagarurwa ahansi;
Eryo izooba MUKAMA wenka niwe arihimbisibwa.

3:
Obwo omuntu aryakwata mwene ishe,
Ow'omu ka ya ishe, amugire ati:
Iwe, nk'oku oine eky'okujwara,
Obe niiwe waaba omutegyeki waitu;
N'eri itongo, obe niiwe waaritegyeka;

Eryo izooba aryahakana, agambe munonga ati:
Tindikwikiriza kuba ow'okubatambira,
Ahabw'okuba omu ka yangye tiharimu by'okurya, nari ebijwaro;
Timurikwija kungira mutegyeki w'abantu;

5:
Mbwenu ka mbagambire eki ndaakore omusiri gwangye gw'emizaabibu.
Niinyija kwihaho orugo rwagwo,
Haza gwonerwe kimwe;
Nsheenye orugo rwagwo rw'amabaare, guribatiirirwe;

Nguraze gurekye kusharirwa n'okuhingirirwa,
Kureka gumerwemu emikwatangwe n'amahwa;
Kandi ndyaragiira ebicu birekye kugugwisiza enjura.

Nikyo abantu bangye barikutwarirwa omu bukwatwa ahabw'okutamanya;
Abashaija baabo b'ekitiinisa bakaitwa enjara,
N'abandi boona bakaitwa omwoma.

Aryaimukiza amahanga ga hare orurango,
Ageetese ekicurizo, garugye aha muheru gw'ensi;
Nago gaija juba nigeehuuta.

6:
Yangira ati: Irooko ogambire abo bantu oti:
Okuhurira kwo muhurire, kwonka mutashoborokyerwa;
N'okureeba mureebe, kwonka muteetegyereza;

8:
Imwe mahanga 'mwe, mweteerane, kwonka muryahendagurika;
Kandi naimwe ab'omu nsi za hare, mutegye amatu mwena;
Mwezirikye, kwonka muryahendagurika;
Mutyo mwezirikye, kwona muryahendagurika.

9:
Ahakuba eby'okurwanisa byona ebihagatirwa abarwani aha rugamba,
N'ebijwaro ebikuringirwe omu shagama,
Biryaba eby'okwokibwa nk'enku omu muriro;

Ahabw'ekiniga kya MUKAMA ow'amahe ensi neesya,
N'abantu baayo nibashusha nk'enku z'okuhembesa omuriro;
Tihariho n'omwe orikusaasira mwene ishe.

Omuntu aryashahura eby'okurya aha rubaju rwa buryo, kwonka agume n'enjara;
Ondiijo aryamirakwo eby'aha rubaju rwa bumosho, kwonka tarihaaga;
Buri muntu aryarya enyama y'omubiri gwa mutaahi we.

10:
Kwonka tikwo arikwenda kukora,
N'omutima gwe tikwo gurikuteekateeka;
Kureka ekiri omu mutima gwe n'okucwekyereza
Kandi n'okumariraho kimwe amahanga gatari makye;

11:
Omu kutiina MUKAMA nimwo arishemerererwa;
Taricwa rubanja rw'amaisho,
N'obu rwakuba orw'okugambirwa,

13:
Terigaruka kutaahwamu,
Nari okutuurwamu obusingye bwona;
Abaharabu tibariteerayo mahema gaabo,
Kandi n'abariisa tibarizaagizayo magana gaabo;

14:
Ekitiinisa kyawe kishuumiibwe n'amaraka g'enanga zaawe,
Bishuumiibwe Okuzimu;
Waayeyarira enyogori, kandi waazeeshweka.

15:
Omutima gwangye niguririra Moabu,
Abanyiginya baayo nibahungira Zoari
Na Egelaasi-shelishiya;
Aharikwinamuka Luhiisi niho barikwinamukira nibacura;
N'omu muhanda ogurikuza Horonaimu
Nimwo barikutakira okutaka kw'abarikucwekyerera.

16:
Nibagira bati: Tuhe obwengye, ocwe emanja z'oburyo;
Omu mushana gw'eihangwe otubeere ekibunda kibe nka nyekiro;
Osherekye encuubwa, kandi otareebya abacwire.

Tukahurira eby'amaryo ga Moabu,
Ku arikwekunika munonga;
Emyekuniko ye, amaryo ge, n'orubwa rwe;
Kwonka okwehimbisa kwe n'okwa busha.

17:
Kwonka haryatsigaramu eby'okuhumba
Nk'ebitsigara omu mutiini gutengyetsiibwe,
Ebijuma bishatu nari bibiri ha itaagi eririkukira agandi aha mutwe;
Kandi ebijuma bitaano nari bina aha mataagi ag'omu mbaju zaagwo agarikwana munonga;
Nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba.

19:
Abanyamisri mbaheyo omu mikono y'omutegyeki w'omwaga,
Kandi bategyekwe omugabe enshaarizi;
Nikwo Mukama, MUKAMA ow'amahe, arikugamba.

Abategi b'eby'enyanja abarikutegyesa amarobo omuri Nailo boona
Baryacura, baboroogye;
N'abarikutegyesa obutimba omu maizi gaayo baryacweka entegye.

21:
N'ahabw'ekyo nyine obusaasi bw'okuunyita;
Ninshaasha munonga nk'omukazi orikurumwa;
Obusaasi nibunzibira kuhurira,
N'okuhahaaza omutima nikunzibira kureeba.

Imwe abatwire omu nsi ya Teema,
Nimureetere abaine eiriho amaizi,
Abarikucwa mubabuganise eby'okurya;

24:
Kandi ebirihika aha bantu b'obutoosha, nibyo birihika n'aha banyamurwa;
Ebirihika aha muhuuku, nibyo birihika ahari mukama we;
Ebirihika aha muzaana, nibyo birihika ahari mugore we;
Ebirihika aha muguzi, nibyo birihika aha mutunzi;
Ebirihika aha muntu orikuguza abandi, nibyo birihika aha muntu orikweguza;
Ebirihika aha muntu orikwihuza, nibyo birihika n'aha muntu orikwihuzibwa.

Ensi neeganya, neehotoka,
Ensi yoona ehweire amaani, neehotoka;
Abeekuniki b'omu nsi bahweire amaani.

Nikyo omukyeeno guhereizeho ensi,
N'abatuuzi baamwo bakasingwa orubanja;
N'ahabw'ekyo abagitwiremu bookiibwe, baatsigara mbarwa.

Nibaboroogyera omu nguuto ahabw'okubura viinyo;
Ahu okushemererwa kubaire kuri, mbwenu n'ekizima;
Okwesiima kw'omu nsi kuhweireho.

N'ahabw'ekyo okwo nikwo biriba aha mahanga g'omu nsi;
Garyaba nk'omutiini ogurikutengyetsibwa,
Nari nk'oku bahumba emizaabibu, eishaaruura rihweire.

Baryateeranirwa hamwe nk'oku embohe ziteeranirwa omu kiina;
Baryakingiranwa omu nju y'ekihome,
Kandi ku harihinguraho ebiro bingi, baryafubirwa.

26:
Niwe agarwire ahansi abatuura omu rurembo orurikwetunguura;
Yaarugarura ahansi, yaaruhitsya aha itaka,
Yaarunaga omu mucuucu.

Ai MUKAMA, tutuura tukutegyereize
Omu muhanda gw'ebiragiro byawe;
Emitima yaitu neeyetenga eiziina ryawe n'okukwijuka.

Abo bakafa, tibarigaruka kubaho;
Bakaba emizimu, tibarizooka;
Nikyo waabateereire okabacwekyereza,
Okatsibyatsibya okwijukwa kwabo kwona.

Imwe bantu bangye 'mwe, nimwije mutaahe omu bishengye byanyu,
Mube mwekingirainemu akaanya kakye,
Okuhitsya ahu ekiniga kiraahwere;

27:
Tiinyine kiniga;
Kwonka emikwatangwe n'amahwa ku byakwija kundwanisa,
Nkaabirwanisa, mbyotsya hamwe byona.

Nari bankwate amaguru ngu mbarinde,
Babone kugira obusingye naanye;
Kandi baryabugira.

28:
Abu yaagizire ati: Okwo nikwo kuhuumura;
Murekye oruhire ahuumure;
Kandi oku nikwo kuruhuuka.
Kwonka baayanga kuhurira.

Mugizire muti: Turagaine endagaano na rufu,
Kandi twikirizaine n'Okuzimu;
Ekibonaboneso ekirikumaraho ku kiriraba omu nsi,
Tikirituhikaho,
Ahabw'okuba tweboneire obuhungiro omu bishuba,
Twayegama omu bugobya;

Buri kaanya ku kiriba nikirabamu, kiryabakwata;
Ahakuba kiryaguma nikirabamu buri kasheeshe,
Kirabemu nyomushana na nyekiro;
Kandi okushoborokyerwa obutumwa kuryaba okwitsa obwoba kwonka.

Ekyo nakyo kiruga ahari MUKAMA ow'amahe;
Niwe muhanuuzi orikutangaaza,
Kandi orikukiza abantu boona obwengye.

29:
Eryo izooba ebifa-matu biryahurira ebigambo by'omu kitabo,
N'empumi ziryahumuuka,
Zikire obuhumi n'omwirima;

30:
Ahakuba obuhwezi bwa Misri tibwine mutambo kandi ni busha;
Nikyo ndikugyetera eiziina
Rahabu oshutami kwonka.

Okwo kutahikiirira kuryababeera
Nk'ekisiika kiraingwa ekishatukire, ekirikugogoma, ekiri haihi kugwa,
Eki okugwa kwakyo kubaho ahonaaho omu kaanya kakye;

Ngaaha! Nitwija kuhungira aha mbaraasi;
Kwokwo muryahunga.
Muti: Nitwija kuhungira aha mbaraasi ezirikwiruka munonga;
N'ahabw'ekyo abaribakurata nabo baryaba abarikwiruka munonga.

31:
Nk'oku amahungu gazeereera,
Nikwo na MUKAMA ow'amahe aririnda Yerusaalemu;
Aryagirinda, agijune;
Aryagisaasira, agikize abazigu.

32:
N'emisiri y'abantu bangye emezirwemu amahwa n'emikwatangwe,
N'amaju goona agarikushemeza
Ag'omu rurembo orurikushemererwa;

33:
Ai MUKAMA, otugirire embabazi, tukutegyereize;
Otubeere amaani buri kasheeshe,
Kandi otubeere okujunwa omu biro by'enaku.

Omu biro byawe aryaba okuhama kwawe,
Okujunwa kwawe kwingi, obwengye n'okumanya;
Okutiina MUKAMA niryo itungo rya Saayuuni.

Yetegyereze Saayuuni, orurembo oru twabaire tukoreramu amagyenyi agaatairweho;
Amaisho gaawe garyareeba Yerusaalemu,
Oshangye eri obutuuro bucureire,
Eihema ryayo tiririfururwa,
Enkondo zaaryo tizirikuurwa ebiro byona,
N'omurunga gwaryo na gumwe tiguricweka;

34:
Ahakuba rurara yangye enywereire munonga omu iguru, yaiguta;
Mbwenu yaaza kushuuma Edomu
N'omu bantu abu naakyeenire, ebahane.

Baryayeta abakungu baayo kwihamu omwe ow'okwemeka,
Kwonka tihaine oribayo;
N'abanyiginya baayo boona baryaba busha.

Musherure omu kitabo kya MUKAMA, mushomemu;
Omuri ebyo tiharigira na kimwe ekiriburayo,
Tiharigira na kimwe ekiribura ekikazi kyakyo;
Ahabw'okuba akanwa ka MUKAMA niko kakiragiire,
Kandi Omwoyo we niwe abiteeraine.

35:
Ekirema kiryaguruka nk'empara,
N'orurimi rw'ekiteta rweshongore ahabw'okushemererwa;
Ahabw'okuba amaizi garyafumuka omu ihamba
N'emigyera omu ihamba ry'omusheenyi;

37:
eki nikyo kigambo eki MUKAMA amugambireho naagira ati:
Saayuuni oshugaine naakugaya, naakushekyerera;
Na Yerusaalemu naakuzongoreza omutwe.

Nkatimba amaziba, naanywa amaizi gaago;
Naaribatiirira emigyera ya Misri yoona,
Naagyomya.

38:
Ohuriire, ohuriire, niwe akusiima,
Nk'oku ndikukusiima eri izooba;
Omuzaire w'abaana abamanyisa obwesigwa bwawe.

40:
Iwe Saayuuni, orikuranga amakuru marungi,
Irooko otembe orushozi ruraingwa;
Iwe Yerusaalemu, orikuranga amakuru marungi,
Imutsya eiraka ryawe n'amaani;
Riimutsye, orekye kutiina;
Ogambire endembo za Yuda oti:
Reeba Ruhanga waanyu!

Reeba, amahanga ni nk'eitondo ry'omu ndobo,
Kandi nigagyeranisibwa n'omucuucu gw'aha minzaani;
Reeba, akiriza ebirwa nk'orikukiriza akantu kakye munonga.

41:
Imwe birwa 'mwe, nimuhuname mumpurire;
K'amahanga gagarukwemu amaani;
Gairire haihi, gagambe;
Twena tuteeranire hamwe, tushoboororane.

Ebirwa bikareeba, byatiina,
Emperu z'ensi zaatetema;
Byairira haihi, byaija.

Kwonka iwe, Israeli omwiru wangye,
Yakobo ou naatooraine,
Oruzaaro rwa Abrahamu munywani wangye;

Reeba, timuri kintu,
Kandi timwine ki mwakukora;
Owaakuba niimwe yaihamu, akaaba ekihagaro.

Nyine ou nyimukize nkaiha aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho;
Mbwenu yaija.
Yaaruga oburugwa-izooba, omuntu orikurahira eiziina ryangye;
Aryaribatiirira abategyeki, nk'orikukaata obudongo,
Kandi nk'omubumbi oku akaata eibumba.

42:
Reeba omuheereza wangye, ou ndamira,
Ou naatooraine, ou omutima gwangye gushemerererwa;
Mmutaireho Omwoyo wangye;
Aryareetera amahanga eby'oburyo.

Orubingo orushatukire tariruhenda,
N'orurimi orurikwaka kubi tariruraaza;
Aryayoreka eby'oburyo omu mazima.

Tariremwa n'obu kwakuba okucuubwa omuhimbo,
Okuhitsya obu ariteeraho kimwe eby'oburyo omu nsi;
N'ebirwa biryategyereza ebiragiro bye.

43:
Ku oriraba omu maizi, ndyaba nkwine;
Ku oriraba omu migyera, terikutwara;
Ku origyendera omu muriro, torisya,
N'ebirimi byagwo tibirikubabura.

Akashohoza ebigaari n'embaraasi,
N'eihe ry'engabo, n'abarwani b'engamba;
Babyama hamwe, tibabaasa kwimuka,
Baraazibwa nk'oku baraaza orumuri;

44:
Nkwerwireho ebicumuro byawe nk'ekicu,
N'ebibi byawe nk'oruho;
Ngarukira, ahabw'okuba nkakucungura.

Iwe iguru 'we, yeshongore;
Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA niwe yaakikozire;
Iwe Okuzimu, gamba munonga;
Imwe enshozi, muteere akaari, mweshongore;
Naiwe Kibira 'we, n'emiti yoona erimu!
Ahakuba MUKAMA acungwire Yakobo,
Kandi aryaheebwa ekitiinisa omuri Israeli.

Orikugamba ahari Kuuro nti: N'omuriisa wangye;
Aryahikiiriza ebi ndikwenda byona;
N'ahari Yerusaalemu nti: Eryayombekwa;
N'ahari hekalu nti: Omusingi gwawe guryateebwaho.

45:
Niinye ntaho omushana, nkahanga omwirima,
Nkareeta obusingye n'enaku;
Niinye MUKAMA okora ebyo byona.

Nkakora ensi, naagihangamu omuntu;
Emikono yangye niyo yaabambire eiguru,
N'amahe gaaryo goona nkagategyeka.

46:
Mukahika n'omu bugurusi, nkiba We;
Kandi muryarugaho mumere enju nkibaheekire.
Niinye naahangire, kandi niinye ndiheeka;
Ndyaheeka, kandi njune.

Bakita aha mabega, bakiheeka;
Bakita omu mwanya gwakyo, kyemereramu;
Tikibaasa kugurugamu;
Omuntu ku akitakira, tikimugarukamu,
N'obu kwakuba okumujuna omu kabi.

Mwijukye ebyabandize kubaho ira,
Ahakuba niinye Ruhanga, tihariho ondiijo;
Niinye Ruhanga; tihariho orikushushana naanye,

47:
Kwata eseiso, ose;
Oyeshuuruure ahamaisho;
Hinyirira ekiteetei kyawe, oyeshuuruure amaguru,
Orabe omu migyera, oyambukye.

Nkagwerwa kubi abantu bangye,
Naagayisa obuhunguzi bwangye;
Naabahayo omu mikono yaawe,
Tiwaabasaasira na kakye,
Abagurusi waabakorera omutwaro guremeire munonga;

Kwonka oryahikwaho akabi,
Aku otarikubaasa kuzibira;
Oryagwerwa akagwe,
Aku otaribaasa kweihaho;
N'okucwekyerera oku otakamanyaga
Kuryakuhikaho kitaraariire.

Okwo nikwo abo abu waabaire ofa kubi nabo barikubeera,
Abaabaire baashuubura naiwe okwiha omu butsigazi bwawe;
Baryayegyendera, buri omwe atoore omuhanda gwe;
Obure ow'okukujuna.

48:
Ebya ira nkabiranga obutakimanywa,
Byaruga omu kanwa kangye, naabimanyisa;
Naabikora ahonaaho, byabaho.

Byahangwa hati, ti bya ira;
Okuhitsya eri izooba tokabihurirahoga,
Ngu otakaagira oti: Nkaba nimbimanya.

Ahabw'eiziina ryangye naaza kuba ndekire kukugirira ekiniga;
Ahabw'okuhimbisibwa kwangye naaza kukugumisiririza,
Ndekye kukwihiraho kimwe.

Nyowe ahabwangye, nyowe nyenka ndyakikora;
Mbwenu eiziina ryangye rijumirwe ki?
Ekitiinisa kyangye tindikiha ondiijo.

Mumpikye haihi, muhurire ebi;
Okuruga aha kutandika tinkagambaga mu mubonano;
Okwiha byaba kubaho ntuurayo.
Mbwenu hati Mukama RUHANGA antumire,
Yantuma n'Omwoyo we.

Nangwa kuri waayorobeire ebiragiro byangye!
Obwo obusingye bwawe bukaabaire nk'omugyera,
N'okuhikiirira kwawe kuba nk'ebingonzi by'enyanja;

Ku yaabeebembeire naabarabya omu ihamba,
Tibaragizire iriho;
Akabaihira amaizi omu rukiri, gaahimintika;
Yaayata orwo rukiri, amaizi gaayerekyera.

49:
Akanwa kangye yaakagira nka rurara y'obwogi,
Yanshereka omu kicuucu ky'omukono gwe;
Yamiika omu mutaana gwe;

Abombeki baawe nibarahutsya kukwombeka;
Kandi abacwekyerezi baawe n'abaakugizire amatongo
Nibaija kukurugamu.

50:
Amabega gangye ngateegyeize abateezi,
N'amatama gangye naagaha abarikumaanyura ebireju;
Tindasherekire maisho gangye enshoni n'okucwerwa amacwante.

Orikuunyihaho orubanja ari haihi;
N'oha orintonganisa?
Ka twemerere, tutongane;
Omuzigu wangye n'oha?
Naanyirire haihi.

51:
Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA aryahuumuriza Saayuuni,
N'emyanya yaayo yoona eyaatsigirweho;
Eihamba ryayo aryarihindura nka Edeni,
N'eihamba ryayo ry'omusheenyi arigire nk'omusiri gwa MUKAMA;
Haryabamu okushemererwa n'okunanuka,
Okusiima n'amaraka g'okweshongora.

Kandi abu MUKAMA yaacungwire baryagaruka,
Baije Saayuuni nibeeshongora;
Okushemererwa okutahwaho kuri aha maisho gaabo;
Baryagira okushemererwa n'okunanuka,
Kandi obusaasi n'okutsinda biryakwata akakiro.

Enkwatwa eyaanyagirwe eryarekurwa juba;
Terifa, ekaza omu kiina;
N'eby'oburyo byayo tibiribura,

52:
Sisiimuka, sisiimuka,
Ojware amaani gaawe, iwe Saayuuni;
Jwara ebijwaro byawe ebirungi,
Iwe Yerusaalemu, orurembo orurikwera;
Ahabw'okuba abatashazirwe n'abatashemeire
Tibarigaruka kukwijamu.

53:
Akaitwa kubi yaabonabonesibwa,
Kwonka tiyaayashamya kanwa ke;
Yaaba nk'akataama akarikutwarwa kwitwa,
Kandi nk'entaama oku ecureera omu maisho g'abakyemuzi b'ebyoya;
Okwo nikwo nawe ataraashamize kanwa ke.

54:
Ku haribaho owaimutsya engamba,
Ziryaba zitarugire ahariinye;
Orikwimukiza engamba aryakuzira.

56:
Abarinzi be n'empumi,
Boona tibaine bwengye,
Boona n'embwa ezikwatsirwe aha munwa,
Ezitarikubaasa kumoka;
Nibaroota, nibabyama, kandi nibakunda kuhungira;

57:
Ataahire omu busingye;
Abagyendera omu kuhikiirira
Bahuumurira aha bitabo byabo.

58:
Amatongo gaawe aga ira garyagaruka gombekwemu;
Oryagaruka oteho emisingi emazire obusingye bwingi egwireho;
Kandi oryayetwa omuhunduuzi w'ahasheenyukire,
Orikugaruraho otuhanda oturikutaaha omu maka.

Obwo oryashemerererwa omuri MUKAMA,
Naanye ndyakuha okutoogooga aha mitwe y'ebibungo by'ensi;
Kandi ndyakutungisa obuhunguzi bwa Yakobo shwenkuru;
Ahabw'okuba akanwa ka MUKAMA niko kaakigamba.

59:
Reeba, omukono gwa MUKAMA tigubaire mugufu
Kutabaasa kujuna,
N'okutu kwe tikufiire kutabaasa kuhurira;

Embubi zaabo tizirikubaasa kuba bijwaro;
Tihaine orikwenda kweshweka ebi bakozire;
Emirimo yaabo n'ey'okutahikiirira,
Ebi barikukora n'engaro zaabo birimu eitima.

Ebigyere byabo biirukira ebibi,
Barahuka kusheesha eshagama y'abataine rubanja;
Ebiteekateeko byabo n'ebiteekateeko by'okutahikiirira;
Ei baza yoona, n'okuhwerekyereza n'okumaraho.

Nikyo eby'oburyo bitubeereire hare,
N'eby'okuhikiirira bitatuhikyeho;
Nitutegyereza omushana, tureeba omwirima;
Tutegyereza okwaka, tugyendera omu mwirima ndindindi.

Tukorakora aha rugo nk'empumi;
Eego, tubandagira nk'abataine maisho.
Tuteera entsibo omu ihangwe nk'omu rwita-waabo;
Omu b'amaani turi nk'emitumbi.

60:
Imutsya amaisho gaawe, omagamagye, oreebe;
Boona nibateerana, nibaija ahariiwe;
Batabani baawe baryaija barugye hare,
Na bahara baawe baije bakiikiirwe omu mikono.

Ahabw'okuba eihanga n'obugabe ebiryanga kukuheereza
Biryahwerekyerera;
Eego, ago mahanga gahwerekyererezibwe kimwe.

61:
Abanyamahanga nibo baribariisiza amasyo,
Abantu b'enduga-mahanga nibo baribahingira,
Bakasharira emizaabibu yaanyu;

Kwonka imwe muryayetwa abanyamurwa ba MUKAMA;
Abantu babeete abaheereza ba Ruhanga waitu;
Muryatungwa obutungi bw'amahanga,
Mwehimbisize omu kitiinisa kyago.

62:
Torigaruka kwetwa Owaatsigirweho,
N'ensi yaawe terigaruka kwetwa Amatongo;
Kureka oryayetwa Enkundwakazi,
N'ensi yaawe eyetwe Oshweirwe;
Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akushemerereirwe,
Kandi ensi yaawe eryashwerwa.

Iwe Yerusaalemu, ntaire abarinzi
Aha ngo zaawe z'amabaare;
Tibarihunama nyomushana na nyekiro.
Imwe abaijutsya MUKAMA, mutahuumura;

63:
Nnyukiire omu inyuukiro nyenka;
Omu bantu b'omu mahanga tihariho n'omwe ou mbaire nyine;
Naabaribata ngwirwe kubi,
Naabaribatiirira nyine ekiniga;
Eshagama yaabo yaataraakira ebijwaro byangye,
Emyenda yangye yaagiibwaho amabara.

Naamagamaga, naareeba hatariho w'okumpa emikono;
Naatangaara kureeba hatariho w'okumpwera;
N'ahabw'ekyo omukono gwangye gwandeetera obusinguzi,
N'ekiniga kyangye kyangumya.

Naaribatiirira amahanga ngwirwe kubi,
Naagasinza n'ekiniga kyangye;
Eshagama yaabo naagishesha ahansi.

Kwonka bakagoma, baagwisa kubi Omwoyo we Orikwera;
N'ahabw'ekyo yaahinduka omuzigu waabo;
Kandi We wenka yaabeerwanisiza.

Manya, niiwe Tataitwe,
N'obu Abrahamu araabe atarikutumanya,
Israeli atwogire;
Iwe MUKAMA niiwe Tataitwe;
Omucunguzi waitu okuruga ira ryona niryo iziina ryawe.

Abantu baawe abarikwera bakamara omwanya mukye
Baine Omwanya gwawe ogurikwera;
Mbwenu abazigu baitu baguribatiriire.

64:
Iwe otangirira abarikushemerererwa eby'okuhikiirira, bakabikora,
Abarikukwijuka, iwe n'emitwarize yaawe;
Kwonka okagira ekiniga ahabw'okuba tukakora ebibi;
Twabimaramu omwanya muhango.
Ebyo turyajunwa?

Kwonka, ai MUKAMA, niiwe Tataitwe,
Itwe turi eibumba, niiwe mubumbi waitu;
Twena turi ebibumbirwe engaro zaawe.

65:
Eizooba ryona nsiiba ntegire emikono eihanga erigomi
Abantu abarikugyendera omu muhanda ogutashemeire,
Nibakuratira obwengye bwabo bonka;

Ndyabateeraho okwitwa rurara;
Mwena muryacureerera okwitwa,
Ahabw'okuba, ku naayetsire, timureetabire;
Ku naagambire, timurategire kutu;
kureka mukakora ebi ntarikusiima,
Mwatoorana ebi ntarikushemerererwa.

N'ahabw'ekyo, oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:
Reeba, abaheereza bangye baryarya,
Kwonka imwe mugume n'enjara;
Reeba, abaheereza bangye baryanywa,
Kwonka imwe mugume n'eiriho;
Reeba, abaheereza bangye baryashemererwa,
Kwonka imwe mwitwe enshoni;

Reeba, nimpanga eiguru risya n'ensi nsya;
Ebya ira tibiriijukwa,
N'obu kwakuba okuteebwaho omutima.

Tibaryombeka maju, abandi bakagataahamu;
Tibaribyara mizaabibu, ekariibwa abandi;
Ahabw'okuba nk'oku ebiro by'omuti biba,
N'eby'abantu bangye nikwo biriba,
Kandi abatoorainwe bangye baryamara omwanya muhango
Nibashemerererwa ebi emikono yaabo ekozire.

66:
Orikwita ente ni nk'orikwita omuntu;
Orikutamba omwana gw'entaama, ni nk'orikuhotora embwa ebitsya;
Orikuhonga empongano y'eby'okunywa ni nk'orikuhonga eshagama y'empunu;
Orikwotera obubaane, ni nk'orikushabira ekishushani ekirikuramibwa omugisha.
Buzima beetooraniire emihanda yaabo,
Emitima yaabo eshemerererwa ebirikunugwa byabo.

Naanye ndyabatooranira okubonabonesibwa,
Nbareeteho ebi barikutiina;
Ahabw'okuba ku naayetsire, haabura owaayetaba;
Ku naagambire, tibaatega matu;
Kureka baakora ebi ntarashemerereirwe.

Ku yaabaire atakarumirwe, yaazaara;
Ku yaabaire atakagizire bisha,
Yaateeraho omwana w'omwojo.

Ahakuba MUKAMA aryacwera abantu boona orubanja,
Abateho ekifubiro ky'omuriro na rurara;
Kandi abariitwa MUKAMA baryaba baingi.

1:
Ku naabaire ntakakuhangire mu nda ya nyoko, nkakumanya;
Naakweza otakazairwe,
Naakutaho kuba nabi w'amahanga.

Otarbatiina,
Ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naiwe kukujuna;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

2:
Mwambukye muhikye aha birwa bya Kitimu, mureebe;
Muteme Kedari, mwetegyereze munonga,
Mureebe ku haraabe harabaireho ekigambo nk'ekyo.

Iwe iguru 'we, kwata aha munwa ahabw'ekyo,
Ogire obwoba bwingi, oshoberwe munonga;
Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira;

Obubi bwawe buryakwehanira,
N'okugaruka enyima kwawe kukuteise;
Omanye, kandi oreebe ku kiri ekintu kibi kandi ekirikushaarira
Kuunyimuura, nyowe MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, otantiine;
Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA ow'amahe arikugira.

Nyeruhiize busha kuteera abaana baanyu;
Tibaikiriza kuhanwa;
Rurara yaanyu niyo emazireho baanabi baanyu
Nk'entare esheegire.

3:
Irooko, orangire ebi bigambo aharikureeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho noogira oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:
Garuka, iwe Israeli owaagarukire enyima,
Tindikwija kukureebesa kiniga,
Ahabw'okuba ndi ow'embabazi;
Tindiguma na kiniga ebiro byona;
Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

4:
Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugambira abantu ba Yuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, ati:
Mutabire endaara zaanyu,
Kandi mutabiba omu mahwa;

5:
Babeihereire MUKAMA,
Nibagira bati: Taine ki arikora;
Tihariho kabi koona akarituhikaho;
Tituriitwa rurara, n'obu kwakuba okuteerwa enjara.

Muhurire eki, imwe abashema, kandi abataine bwengye,
Abaine amaisho, kwonka batarikureeba,
Abaine amatu, kwonka batarikuhurira;

Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:
Timurikutiina? Timurikutetemera omu maisho gangye?
Nkataho omusheenyi kuba omwatano gw'enyanja,
Omucungiro gw'ebiro byona, ogu etarikubaasa kurengyeraho;
Ebingozi n'obu byakwecunda bita, tibikaabaasa;
Kandi n'obu byakuhoorera bita, tibikaagurengyeraho.

Amaju gaabo gaijwire obugobya,
Nk'ekitukuru kiijwire enyonyi;
N'ahabw'ekyo bahindukire bakuru n'abatungi,

Bagomokire, baasiigiriza;
Omu kukora kubi tibaine bugarukiro;
Emanja z'efuuzi tibazicwa mu bwinganisa,
Ngu ezo fuuzi zibe gye,
Kandi tibatonganira bakyene.

6:
Nk'oku enshuro eguma neereeta amaizi gaayo,
Narwo nikwo ruguma nirureeta obubi bwarwo;
Obubisha n'okucwekyereza nibiruhurirwamu;
Obutoosha nindeeba endwara n'okuhutaazana.

Amaju gaabo garyaba ag'abandi,
N'emisiri yaabo hamwe n'abakazi baabo;
Ahabw'okuba ndyabangira abatwire omu nsi omukono;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Kandi nkataho ab'okubarinda ningira nti:
Mute omutima aha iraka ry'enzamba;
Kwonka baagira bati: Titurikwija kugugyenderama.

Boona n'abagomi kandi enteegi,
Nibagyenda nibabeiherera abandi;
Bagumire nk'omuringa nari nk'ekyoma;
Boona nibakora ebitahikire.

8:
Buzimazima enkongoro ez'omu mwanya
Zimanya obunaku bwazo;
Enkombe, entaratambi n'entuuha
Bimanya obunaku bwabyo bw'okwiziramu;
Beitu abantu bangye bo tibarikumanya
Ekiragiro kya MUKAMA.

Beitu, ku baaherize kukora ebihagaro, bakagira enshoni?
Ngaaha! Tibarazigizire na kakye,
N'obu kwakuba okubwerabwera;
N'ahabw'ekyo baryagwa omuri abo abagwa;
Omu bunaku obu ndibafubiririramu,
Baryakumbagazibwa; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Tutegyereize obusingye, kwonka titwine karungi aku tureebire;
Tutegyereize obunaku bw'okutambirirwamu,
Mbwenu reeba, haija ebirikutiinisa.

9:
Bananuura orurimi rwabo nk'obuta, rurekura ebishuba;
Bahinduka ab'amaani omu nsi, kwonka kutarikurwanira mazima;
Kureka ku baheza kukora ekibi, bagaruka bakora ekindi,
Kandi tibarikummanya; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati:
Muteekateekye, mwete abakazi abarikumanya kucura,
Mutume aha bakazi abahangu, baije;

Barahukye, batucurire,
Amarira gatufukunkukye omumaisho,
n'ebitsigye byaitu bihimintikye amaizi;

Imwe bakazi 'mwe, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA,
Kandi amatu gaanyu gaakiire ekigambo ekirikuruga omu kanwa ke;
Mwegyese bahara baanyu okucura,
Kandi buri muntu ayegyese mutaahi we okutonzya;

10:
Bareeta ebibaati by'efeeza ebi baihire Tarushiishi,
N'ezaabu eya Ufaazi.
Ebyo bishushani n'omurimo gw'abanyamyoga n'abaheesi b'ezaabu;
Ebijwaro byabo n'ebya bururu na bujwa;
Byona bikorwa abahangu.

Shuka ekiniga kyawe aha mahanga agatarikukumanya,
Aha nganda ezitatakira iziina ryawe;
Ahabw'okuba bashonshomeire Yakobo;
Bamushonshomeire, baamumaraho,
N'ahu atwire baahahindura amatongo.

12:
Ahabw'okuba beene sho n'ab'enju ya sho
Nabo bakureebize;
Nibakuyombera enyima, bakubingire;
N'obu barikugambira gye, otaribeesiga.

Obuhunguzi bwangye bumpindukiire entare y'omu kibira,
Bwaimutsya eiraka ryabwo, bwantontomera;
Nikyo ndikubwangira.

Abariisa baingi basiisire omusiri gwangye gw'emizaabibu,
Baaribatiirira omugabo gwangye;
Omugabo gwangye murungi baagugira eihamba eritatuurwamu.

13:
Ebyo nigwo mugabo gwawe ogu naakuteekateekyeire
Ahabw'okuunyebwa, okeesiga ebishuba;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

14:
Enturegye nizeemerera aha bibungo by'emparamaata,
Zihaahagira nk'emishega;
Amaisho gazigwire omunda ahabw'okubura obunyaatsi.

N'obu eby'okushiisha byaitu biraabe nibitushinja,
Ai MUKAMA, kora ahabw'eiziina ryawe;
Ahabw'okuba okugaruka enyima kwaitu ni kwingi;
Tukakucumuraho.

Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba ahari aba bantu naagira ati:
Okwo nikwo baayenzire kurara
Batabandame hamwe;
Nikyo MUKAMA atarikubaikiririza;
Aryaijuka eby'okushiisha byabo,
Abafubire ahabw'ebibi byabo.

Ai MUKAMA, twemeire obubi bwaitu,
N'eby'okushiisha bya baatatenkuriitwe;
Ahabw'okuba tukakucumuraho.

Otatutamirwa kimwe, ahabw'eiziina ryawe;
Otakwatsa enshoni ekitebe kyawe ky'ekitiinisa.
Ijuka endagaano ei waaragaine naitwe, otagiita.

15:
Kandi ku baraakubuuze bati: Tuze hi? obagire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:
Ab'okwitwa rufu, baitwe rufu;
Ab'okwitwa rurara, baitwe rurara;
Ab'okwitwa enjara, baitwe enjara,
N'ab'okutwarwa omu bukwatwa, batwarwe.

Nkabeeresa orugari omu marembo g'ensi,
Naabamaraho abaana, naacwekyereza abantu bangye;
Kwonka tibaareka mitwarize yaabo mibi.

Owaazaire mushanju ayehweire amatsiko,
Yaagwa enshazi;
Eizooba rye ryarenga butakaizire;
Akwatsirwe enshoni, yaabwerabwera.
Kandi abahonokireho ndyabacwekyerereza
Omu maisho g'abazigu baabo na rurara;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Ai MUKAMA, niiwe orikumanya;
Onyijukye, ontaayaayire,
Ompoorere enzigu abarikumpiiga;
Ahabw'okugumisiriza kwawe otaanyihaho,
Omanye ku ndikujumwa ninturwa iwe ahabwawe.

Ahari abo bantu ndyakugira orugo orwombekyeise emiringa;
Baryakurwanisa, kwonka tibarikubaasa,
Ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naiwe
Kukukiza n'okukwiha omu mikono yaabo;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

17:
Omutima n'engobya okukira ebintu byona,
Gwine endwara etarikutambwa;
N'oha owaakubaasa kugumanya?

Ntambira, ai MUKAMA, nibwo ndaatambirwe;
Njuna, nibwo ndaajunwe;
Ahabw'okuba niiwe ky'okutiinisa kyangye.

K'abarikumpiiga bakwatwe enshoni,
Kwonka nyowe zirekye kunkwata;
Bo bahahaare omutima,
Kwonka ogwangye gurekye kuhahaara;
Obahitsyeho eizooba ry'akabi,
Obahwerekyereze kabiri.

18:
N'ahabw'ekyo orekye abaana baabo baitwe enjara;
Kandi obaheyo, bamarweho rurara;
Abakazi baabo babe abamazire abaana, kandi abafaakazi,
Abashaija baabo bamarweho orufu,
N'abatsigazi baabo baitirwe rurara omu rugamba.

25:
Obwaku nibwija kuhika aha muheru gw'ensi,
Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA aine eki arikufa n'amahanga;
Naija kutonganisa abaine omubiri boona,
N'ababi abaitse rurara;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

30:
Ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naiwe kukujuna;
Nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.
Ndyamariraho kimwe amahanga goona,
Agu naakutaataanisiizemu;
Kwonka iwe tindikumariraho kimwe,
Kureka ndyakuteera ninkubarira;
Kandi hoona tindikureka ntakufubiire.

Reeba, eihunga rya MUKAMA!
Ekiniga kye kyashohora nk'omuyaga gw'akasooroora;
Nikiza kuteera emitwe y'ababi.

31:
Obwo nibwo abaishiki barizina, bakashemererwa,
Abatsigazi n'abagurusi bakeesiimira hamwe;
Ahabw'okuba okucura ndyakuhindura okushemererwa,
Mbahuumurize, mbahe okwesiima omu mwanya gw'enaku;

Kandi amagara g'abanyamurwa ndyagaigutsa eby'ebishaju,
Abantu bangye bahaagye oburungi bwangye;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:
Zibira eiraka ryawe kucura,
N'amaisho gaawe kuhimintikwamu amarira;
Ahabw'okuba ebi orikukora biryakuhaisa ebihembo,
Kandi abo baana baryaruga omu nsi y'abazigu baabo, bagarukye;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Hakiriho amatsiko ahabw'ebirikubaho bwanyima;
Abaana baawe baryagaruka omu nsi yaabo y' obuzaarwa;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Nkahurira Efuraimu naaborooga ati:
Okampana, naahanwa
Nk'ekimasha kitakeegyesiibwe kuhinga;
Ongarure, mbone kugarurwa;
Ahabw'okuba niiwe MUKAMA, Ruhanga wangye.

Omu biro ebyo tibarigaruka kugira bati:
Abazaire bariire emizaabibu erikushaarira,
Amaino g'abaana gaaba nigo gaagira amangigina;

46:
Mbwenu naaba naakireebera ki?
Bahahaize emitima, baagaruka enyima,
N'amamanzi gaabo gasingwirwe,
Gairuka nigahunga, gatarikureeba nyima;
Ebirikutiinisa biri embaju zoona;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Ahakuba eryo izooba n'eizooba rya MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe,
Eizooba ry'okuhooreraho abazigu be enzigu;
Rurara eryarya, ehaagye,
Enywe eshagama yaabo, eigute;
Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'amahe, naatambira ebitambo
Aha mugyera Furaati aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho.

Nangwa n'abaserukare abarikukorera ebihembo
Ni nk'enyana ezigomokire;
Eego, bahindukire, boona baahunga;
Tibaayemerera;
Ahakuba eizooba ryabo ry'okugwererwaho akagwe riizire,
Nibwo bunaku bw'okufubirwa kwabo.

48:
Ebya Moabu. Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati:
Neebo eryakareeba, ahabw'okuhindurwa amatongo;
Kiryasaimu ehemwirwe, yaakwatwa;
Ekigo kyayo kihemwirwe,

Omuhwerekyerezi aryagwa aha ndembo zoona kitaraariire;
Tihariho rurembo na rumwe orurikira;
Oruhanga ruryahwerekyerera,
N'oruhita ruryacwekyerezibwa,
Nk'oku MUKAMA agizire.

Moabu akagogyera okuruga omu buto bwe,
Yaateeka nka viinyo y'omurera;
Tarashukanwirwe mu zindi nyungu,
N'obu kwakuba okuza omu bukwatwa;
Nikyo agumiire n'obunuzi bwe,
N'omugaju gwe tigukahindukire.

Omuhwerekyerezi wa Moabu n'endembo ze aizire,
Abatsigazi be entoore bashuumire kwitwa;
Nikwo Mukama, ou eiziina rye riri MUKAMA ow'amahe, arikugira.

MUKAMA naagira ati: Nimmanya orubwa rwe;
Ebi arikwehimbisizaho ti by'amazima,
Kandi n'ebi arikukora n'eby'ebishuba.

Iwe muzaabibu gwa Sibuma 'we,
Ndyakucurira okukira oku naacuriire Yazeri;
Amataagi gaawe gakambuka enyanja,
Gaahika Yazeri;
Omuhwerekyerezi ayetwire
Omu myaka yaawe y'ekyanda n'omu mizaabibu yaawe.

Okwesiima n'okushemererwa biihirwe
Omu nsi ya Moabu erikweza.
Nkabuza viinyo omu manyuukiro;
Tihariho orikunyuuka naateera akaari;
Kandi n'obu bariteera akaari,
Tikariba k'okushemererwa.

Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:
Reeba, haryagira owaaguruka nk'eishamba,
Amapapa ge agashashaanure kurwanisa Moabu;

Orihunga ekirikutiinisa aryagwa omu kiina,
N'oriruga omu kiina aryagwa omu mutego;
Ahabw'okuba ebyo byona ndyabireeta ahari Moabu
Omu mwaka gw'okufubirwa kwabo;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

49:
Nikyo abatsigazi baarwo barigwera omu nteeraniro z'enguuto,
Kandi ahari eryo izooba abaserukare baarwo boona baryacwekyerezibwa;
nikwo MUKMA arikugira.

Imwe batuuzi ba Hazori 'mwe,
Nimuhungye, muze hare, mutuure omu bicokoromi ahatarikuhikwa;
Ahabw'okuba Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni
Acumire enaama y'okubarwanisa,
Kandi amaririire kubateera;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

50:
Inamuka, oteere ensi ya Merasaimu,
Oteere n'abatuuzi ba Pekodi;
Obaite; ku oriheza kubaita, ocwekyerereze kimwe,
Okore byoan ebi naakuragiire;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Nimwije, mugiteere, nimugireetwa embaju zoona,
Mwigure ebitara byayo;
Mugicwekyerereze kimwe, mutagira ekyayo eki mwatsigaho.

Rurara yaaza kwita abafumu,
Bahindukye ebifeera;
Yaaza kwita amamanzi gaayo, gacwekyerezibwe.

Reeba, eihanga niriija, niriruga omu bukiizi-bwa-bumosho;
Eihanga ry'amaani n'abagabe baingi
Nibaimuka nibaruga omu bicweka ry'ensi ebirikuhereerukayo.

Bakwaitse amata na'amacumu;
N'enshaarizi, tibaine saasi.
Orwari rwabo ni nk'enyanja erikuhoorera;
Nibagyendera aha mbaraasi,
Bajwaire nk'omuntu orikuza aha rugamba
Kukurwanisa, iwe Babulooni!

51:
MUKAMA ayorekire ku tutaine rubanja;
Mwije tumanyise omuri Saayuuni
Omurimo gwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu.

Buri muntu ni nk'enyamaishwa, taine bwengye;
Buri muheesi w'ezaabu ahemwirwe ebishushani bye ebirikuramibwa;
Ahabw'okuba ebishushani bye n'eby'ebishuba,
Tibiine mwitsyo.

Ori enyondo yangye kandi eky'okurwanisa kyangye;
Niiwe nsheenyaguza amahanga,
Kandi niiwe ncwekyerezesa ensi z'abagabe;

Niiwe nsheenyaguza ekigaari ky'orugamba n'omuvugi waakyo;
Niiwe ncwagacwaguza abashaija n'abakazi;
Niiwe ncwagacwaguza abagurusi n'abatsigazi;
Niiwe ncwagacwaguza abatsigazi n'empangare;

Niiwe ncwagacwaguza omuriisa n'obusyo bwe;
Niiwe ncwagacwaguza omuhingi n'ente ze ezi arikuhingisa;
Kandi niiwe ncwagacwaguza abategyeki n'abakuru b'engabo.

Muhateekateekyere amahanga g'okuhateera,
Abagabe b'Abameedi hamwe n'abategyeki baabo n'abatsigire baabo;
Na buri ihanga eriri omu butegyeki bwabo.

Abarwani ba Babulooni barekyeire aho okurwana,
Baaguma omu bigo byabo ebigumire;
Eishaija ribahweire, baaba nk'abakazi;
Amaka gaabo nigasya,
Emikingo yaabo ehendagwirwe.

Ku bariba bakiine ekiniga, ndyabateekyera obugyenyi,
Mbasiinze, bashemererwe,
Bagwejegyere obutasisiimuka;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira;

Ndyasinza abanyiginya baayo, abanyabwengye baayo,
Abategyeki, abakuru b'engabo n'abarwani baayo;
Baryagwejegyera obutasisiimuka;
nikwo MUKAMA ou eiziina rye riba MUKAMA ow'amahe, arikugira.

1:
Ahabw'okubonabonesibwa n'ahabw'obuhuuku bw'amaani
Yuda agiire omu bukwatwa;
Hati atwire omu mahanga,
Kwonka abuzire ah'okuhuumurira;
Abarikumuhiiga boona bamukwatsire,
Enaku zimukondahiriire.

Emihanda erikuza Saayuuni neecura,
Ahabw'okubura omuntu weena owaija aha magyenyi agaatairweho;
Amarembo gaayo goona n'ebifurukwa;
Abanyamurwa baayo nibatsinda,
Abaishiki baayo bakurwirwe, baatwarwa,
Kandi nayo neeshaasha munonga.

Ekitiinisa kya Saayuuni kyona kigihweireho;
Abanyiginya baayo babaire nk'empara zibuzire oburiiro;
Bahungire abarikubahiiga nibakooza.

Yerusaalemu ekashiisha munonga,
Nikyo yaahindukiire ekihagaro;
Boona abaabaire bagiha ekitiinisa, hati nibagigaya;
Ahabw'okuba bareebire enjuuro yaayo;
Eego yo neetsinda, ehugika omushaya.

Omuzigu naakununkirira ebintu byayo byona eby'obuguzi bwingi;
Eego, ereebire amahanga gahurwire nigataaha omu Mwanya gwayo ogurikwera,
Agu waazibiire kutaaha omu iteeraniro ry'abantu baawe.

Akeema ahaiguru, yaayohereza omuriro,
Yaagushuumya omu magufa gangye;
Yaatega ebigyere byangye ekigoya,
Yangarura enyima;
Yantsigaho nyeshobeire,
Ningwa enshazi eizooba ryona.

2:
Ananwire obuta bwe nk'omuzigu,
Ayemereire abangire omukono gwe gwa buryo nk'omubisha;
Aitsire boona abashemeza amaisho gaitu
Abari omu ihema rya Saayuuni;
Yaashuka ekiniga kye nk'omuriro.

MUKAMA amaririire kusheenyera kimwe
Orugo rwa Saayuuni;
Yaarugyeresa omugoye;
Tiyaahinya mukono gwe kurekyera aho okucwekyereza;
Yaareetera ekigo n'orugo kutonzya,
Amaani gaabihweramu hamwe.

Baanabi baawe boorekirwe ahabwawe
Eby'ebishuba kandi ebirikuhabisa;
Tiboorekire butunu by'okutahikiirira kwawe
Kugarura abantu baawe abaatwairwe omu bukwatwa;
Kureka ahabwawe boorekirwe
Okuragura kw'ebishuba kandi okurikuhabisa.

Abato n'abakuru babyami omu mucuucu gw'enguuto;
Empangare zangye n'abatsigazi bangye
Baitsirwe rurara;
Waabaita aha izooba ry'ekiniga kyawe,
Waabamaraho otaine saasi.

Oyetsire ebirikuunyitsa obwoba embaju zoona,
Nk'oku beeta abantu aha izooba ry'obugyenyi obuteekateekirwe,
Aha izooba ry'ekiniga kya MUKAMA;
Tihaine waarokokire nari owaahonokireho;
Abu naakiikiire nkoorora
Omuzigu wangye abamazireho.

4:
Kwonka hati aha maisho gaabo nihakiza enziro kwiragura;
Tibaakimanywa omu nguuto;
Omubiri gwabo guramataine na'amagufa gaabo,
Gwayoma, gwaba nk'ekiti.

Abantu baatuhiiga batuhambize,
Kyatuzibira kuraba omu nguuto zaitu;
Omuheru gwaitu gwairira haihi; ebiro byaitu byaba mbarwa;
Ahabw'okuba omuheru gwaitu gukaba guhikire.

23:
Oryaijura esindo n'obujune.
Ekikopo kya mukuru waawe Samaria
N'eky'okutiinisa kandi eky'okweshobera;

24:
Ogitemu entongo z'enyama,
Entongo nungi zoona, ez'ekivune ky'okuguru n'eky'omukono,
Ogiijuze amagufa marungi;

27:
Bakashara embaaho zaawe zoona
Omu miberooshi y'omuri Seniiri;
Baiha omwereezi omuri Lebanooni,
Baagukubaijeramu omurongooti;

28:
Ahabw'okugira obwengye bwingi omu kushuubura,
Okanyiise obutungi bwawe,
Omutima gwawe gwabwehimbisizamu;

Omu bushuubuzi bwawe bwingi
Okaijuriramu eitima, waacumura;
Nikyo naakubingiire nk'ekintu kisiisikaire,
Nkakwiha aha rushozi rwa Ruhanga;
Kerubi ogwo omurungi akakubinga
omuri ago mabaare g'omuriro.

Ab'omu mahanga boona abarikukumanya,
Nibakutangaarira;
Ofiire kubi: torigaruka kubaho ebiro byona.

Mwana w'omuntu, ta amaisho gaawe ahari Sidoni, ogihanuurire ebirigibaho, noogira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati:
Iwe Sidoni, reeba naaba omuzigu waawe;
Niinyija kworeka ekitiinisa kyangye omuriiwe.

Kandi ku ndiheza kugireetamu ebifubiro,
N'okugyorekamu okwera kwangye,
Obwo baryamanya ku ndi MUKAMA;

Ahabw'okuba ndyagyoherereza orufu,
Nsheeshe eshagama omu nguuto zaayo;
Abariitwa baryagwa ahagati yaayo,
Nibaitwa rurara erikugirwansia embaju zoona;
Obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.

30:
Ahabw'okuba eryo izooba riri haihi;
Eizooba rya MUKAMA riri haihi;
Riryaba eizooba ry'ekibunda,
Bube obunaku bw'ekifubiro ky'amahanga.

Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:
Abantu abarikuhwera Misri baryagwa,
Kandi amaani agu erikwehimbisizaho garyaikaikana;
Abantu baayo baryaitwa rurara
Okuruga Migidooli okuhika Syene;
Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.

31:
Okwo nikwo gwabaire murungi omu buhango bwagwo
N'omu buraingwa bw'amataagi gaagwo;
Ahabw'okuba gukaba gutsimbire emizi okuzimu omu maizi maingi.

32:
Ebirikwakira omu iguru byona ndyabikuraarizaho,
N'ensi yaawe ngishwekye omwirima;
Nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.

Obwo nibwo ndishemeza amaizi gaayo,
Nkareetera emigyera yaayo kuhimintika nk'amajuta;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

2:
Niwe ahindura obunaku n'emyaka;
Niwe aihaho, abagabe, akataho abandi;
Aha abanyabwengye obwengye,
N'abarikwetegyereza abaha okumanya;

Ashuuruura ebya hare ebitarikumanywa;
Amanya ebiri omu mwirima,
Kandi n'omushana gutuura nawe.

4:
Bwanyima y'ebyo biro, nyowe Nebukadeneeza nkaimutsya amaisho gangye ahainguru, naagarukwamu akengye, naasiima Rukira-boona, naahimbisa Otahwaho ebiro byona, naamuha ekitiinisa;
Ahabw'okuba obutegyeki bwe n'obutegyeki obutahwaho,
Kandi obukama bwe bugumaho, nk'oku obusingye bugyenda nibwihaihana.

6:
Niwe ajuna, kandi akakiza;
Niwe akora obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza omu iguru n'omu nsi;
Kandi niwe ajunire Danieli, akamwiha omu byara by'entare.

7:
Kandi eby'amahembe ikumi,
Omuri obwo bugabe haryaimukamu abagabe ikumi;
Bwanyima yaabo haimukye ondiijo mugabe,
Abe ow'omutaano aha baamubandiize;
Kandi bashatu ahari abo aryabagarura ahansi.

2:
Ndyamufubira, mmuture amagyenyi ga Baabaali,
Abu yaabaire ayooterera obubaane,
Akeehunda empeta omu matu n'amahunde,
Akakuratira nkunzi ze;
Haza nyowe akaanyebwa;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

4:
Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, nimuhurire ekigambo kaya MUKAMA;
Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA naatonganisa abatuuzi b'omuri egi nsi,
Naagira ati:
Omu nsi egi tiharimu bwesigwa, nari embabazi,
N'obu kwakuba okumanya Ruhanga;

Kwonka hatagira owaatongana,
Kandi hatagira owaatabaaza;
Ahakuba iwe munyamurwa 'we, niiwe ndikutonganisa.

Abantu bangye nibacwekyerezibwa ahabw'okubura okumanya;
Naiwe ahabw'okwanga okumanya
Naanye niinyanga ku oba omunyamurwa wangye;
Kandi nk'oku oyebirwe ebiragiro bya Ruhanga waawe,
Naanye ndyayebwa abaana baawe.

Omunyamurwa n'abantu nikyo kimwe;
Ndyabafubira ahabw'emitwarize yaabo,
Mbazimuurire ahabw'ebi baakozire.

5:
Imwe banyamurwa 'mwe, nimuhurire eki;
Naimwe ab'enju ya Israeli, mutegye amatu;
Kandi naimwe ab'enju y'omugabe nimuhurire,
Ahabw'okuba orubanja n'orwanyu,
Mubaire omutego ahari Mizipa,
N'ekigoye ekitegire ahari Tabora.

Muteerere enzamba omuri Gibea,
N'eikondere omuri Raama;
Muteerere enduuru Besaveeni;
Iwe Benyamiini, tetema!

6:
Nibagira bati:
Nimwije, tugarukire MUKAMA;
Ahabw'okuba niwe yaatuhutaize, kandi niwe aritutambira;
Niwe yaatuteire, kandi niwe aritushemba.

Bwanyima y'ebiro bibiri, aryatuhimbuura;
Kandi aha kiro kya kashatu arytuzoora,
Tubone kuguma turi abahuriire omu maisho ge.

Ka tumanye MUKAMA, tugumizemu kumumanya;
Okwija kwe ni nk'omushekye, tikuribura;
Aryatuhikaho nk'enjura,
Nke'njura ya katumba erikwitirira eitaka.

Nikyo naabakondeseize baanabi,
Nkabaita n'ebigambo by'omu kanwa kangye;
Kandi emanja zangye ezi ncwa ni nk'omushana ogubuga hoona;

Ndeebire ekihagaro omu nju ya Israeli;
Okwo niyo obwamaraaya bwa Efuraimu buri,
Israeli esiisikaire.

7:
Ku mba niinyenda kutambira Israeli,
Okutahikiirira kwa Efuraimu
N'ebibi ebi Abasamaria barikukora bishuuruuka;
Ahabw'okuba bakora eby'obugobya,
Omushuma afumura enju,
Kandi aheeru omutwe gw'abambuzi gunyaga;

Ahabw'okuba emitima yaabo neebugumwamu enaama mbi;
Ekiniga kyabo kiraara nikyaka mpora-mpora;
Bukisheesha kyaka nk'omuriro gurikubuguma.

Ku bariba nibagyenda, ndyabarengyezaho ekigoye kyangye;
Kandi ndyabahanura nk'enyonyi z'omu mwanya,
Mbahane ahabw'ebibi ebi barikukora.

8:
Bakeemeka abagabe, ntabaragiire;
Baayeteeraho abategyeki, ntarikukimanya;
Baakora ebishushani ebirikuramibwa
Omu feeza n'ezaabu zaabo kwecwekyereza.

Egyo nyana ya Samarita ti Ruhanga;
Omuheesi niwe yaagiheesire,
Eryacwagurika.

Ahakuba nibabiba omuyaga;
Bwanyima baryagyesha akasooroora.
Omugusha gukuzire, tigwine bikumba;
Tigurirugamu njuma;
N'obu zaakurugamu,
Abanyamahanga bakaazirya.

Ahabw'okuba bainamukire Asiria,
Ni nk'enturegye erikuzengyerera yonka;
Efuraimu aguririire nkunzi ze.

Bakunda kutamba ebitambo;
Batamba enyana, bagirya;
Kwonka MUKAMA tabishemerererwa.
Mbwenu naija kwijuka eby'okushiisha byabo,
Abafubire ahabw'ebibi byabo;
Bagarukye Misri.

Ahabw'okuba Israeli ayebirwe Omuhangi we,
Yaayeyombekyera zaanyaruju;
Na Yuda akanyiise endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare;
Kwonka ndyatweka omuriro omu ndembo ze,
Gwotsye ebigo bye.

9:
Tibariguma mu nsi ya MUKAMA,
Kureka Abaefuraimu baryagaruka Misri;
Kandi Asiria baryatungirwayo eby'okurya bitashemeire.

Tibarishukira MUKAMA mpongano za viinyo ez'okunywa,
N'obu kwakuba okumugwisa gye n'ebitambo byabo.
Eby'okurya byabo biryaba nk'eby'abari omu rufu;
Abaribiryaho boona baryasiisikara;
Ahabw'okuba eby'okurya byabo biryaba biri eby'okubatambira enjara kwonka;
Tibirishuuza mu nju ya MUKAMA.

Ahabw'okuba reeba, nibaza Asiria;
Misri eryabarunda hamwe,
Memufiisi ebaziikye;
Ebintu byabo by'efeeza eby'obuguzi bwingi biryashwekwa ebicurangyenyi,
N'amahwa gamere omu mahema gaabo.

Buri kibi kyabo nikishangwa omuri Gilugaali;
Okwo niyo naabandiize kubanga.
Ndyababinga omu nju yangye
Ahabw'obubi bw'emicwe yaabo.
Tindigaruka kubakunda;
Abategyeki baabo boona n'abagomi.

10:
Ahabw'okuba hati nibaija kugira bati:
Titwine mugabe, ahabw'okutoorobera MUKAMA;
Mbwenu omugabe akaatugasira ki?

Iwe Israeli, okwiha omu biro bya Gibea otuura noocumura;
Okwo niyo baagumiriizemu.
Nimugira ngu orugamba tiruribahikiraho omuri Gibea?

Ndyateera abo bantu b'ebyegyengye, mbafubire;
Kandi amahanga garyteerana kubarwanisa,
Ku bariba bafubiirwe ahabw'ekibi kyabo ekirimu bibiri.

11:
Hoona niinye naayegyeise Abaefuraimu kugyenda,
Nkabakiikira omu mikono;
Kwonka tibaramanyire ku niinye naabatambiire.

Abantu bangye bagwereire orubaju rw'okundugaho;
Nikyo bateereirweho omugamba gw'obuhuuku,
Kandi tihaine origubaihaho.

Tindikwija kukora nk'ekiniga kyangye kingi oku kiri;
Tindigaruka kucwekyereza Efuraimu;
Ahabw'okuba ndi Ruhanga, tindi muntu,
Orikwera ori ahagati omuriimwe;
Kandi tindiija kuhwerekyereza.

12:
Abaefuraimu nibatungwa omuyaga,
Kandi eizooba ryona nibakuratira omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba;
Nibakanyisa ebishuba n'obubisha;
Nibaragaana endagaano n'Abaasiria,
Kandi n'amajuta nigatwarwa omuri Misri.

(Yakobo akahungira omu nsi ya Aramu;
Okwo niyo Israeli yaakorereire omukazi,
Akariisa entaama, ngu abone kushwera.)

Efuraimu akagwisa kubi munonga MUKAMA;
N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA aryamureka, orubanja rw'okusheesha eshagama rumugumeho,
N'ebijumo bye abimugarureho.

13:
Efuraimu ku yaabaire agamba, abantu batetema,
Ayetunguura omuri Israeli;
Kwonka ku yaayereetsireho orubanja ahabwa Baali, yaafa.

Kwonka ku baariire, baiguta,
Baahaaga, emitima yaabo yaayetunguura;
N'ahabw'ekyo baanyebwa.

Ebisha by'omukazi orikurumwa nibiija ahabwe;
Kwonka n'omwana otaine bwengye,
Ahabw'okuba hati takatandikire kushuuriza.

14:
Asiria teritujuna;
Titurigyendera ha mbaraasi;
Titurigaruka kugira ebikozirwe emikono yaitu
Tuti: Muri baaruhanga baitu.
Ahabw'okuba omuriiwe nimwo efuuzi zishanga embabazi.

Ndyabakiza okugaruka enyima kwabo,
Mbakunde, bataine ki bahaire;
Ahabw'okuba tinkibainiire kiniga.

Oine obwengye weena ayetegyereze ebyo;
Oine okwetegyereza, abimanye;
Ahabw'okuba emihanda ya MUKAMA egororokire,
Kandi abahikiriire baryagigyendaramu,
Kwonka abasiisi baryagigwamu.

1:
Empongano z'esaano n'ez'eby'okunywa
Zicwirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA;
Abanyamurwa abarikuheereza MUKAMA nibacura.

Emisiri emazirweho, ensi ecuramiriirwe;
Ahabw'okuba engano zihweireho,
Viinyo eyomire, kandi amajuta gabuzire.

Imwe banyamurwa 'mwe, nimwezirikye ebiguniya, mutonzye;
Naimwe abaheereza aha itambiro, muboroogye!
Imwe baheereza ba Ruhanga wangye 'mwe,
Nimwije museese ekiro mujwaire ebiguniya;
Ahabw'okuba empongano z'esaano n'ez'eby'okunywa
Zicwirwe omu nju ya Ruhanga waanyu.

Amatungo nigaboroogyerana!
Amasyo g'ente gashobeirwe ahabw'okubura obunyaatsi;
Nangwa n'amasyo g'entaama gaburaburiirwe.

2:
Iwe nsi 'we, otatiina;
Shemererwa kandi oyesiime,
Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akozire bikuru!

Imwe baana ba Saayuuni 'mwe, nimushemererwe;
Mwesiimire omuri MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu;
Ahabw'okuba abahaire enjura y'ebiba ey'orugyero ruhikire,
Kandi yaabagwisiza enjura nyingi munonga
Ey'eibiba n'eya katumba nk'eya bwabiso.

Muryamanya ku ndi omu Baisraeli,
Kandi ku nyowe, MUKAMA, ndi Ruhanga waanyu, ku hatariho ondiijo;
N'abantu bangye tibarigaruka kuhemurwa bundi.

3:
Amafuka gaanyu mugaheeshemu zaarurara,
N'empabyo zaanyu muziheeshemu amacumu;
Otaine maani ahigye ati, Ndi ow'amaani.

Mutwekyere omusyo gw'engyesho,
Ahabw'okuba eigyesha rihikire;
Mwije munyuukye, ahabw'okuba einyuukiro riijwire;
Amaato gaijwire viinyo nigasheesheka,
Ahabw'okuba obubi bwabo ni bwingi.

1:
Ndyahenda empimbi y'eirembo rya Damasiko,
Mmareho abatwire omu ruhita rwa Aveeni,
N'okwaitse enkoni y'obugabe omuri Besedeni;
Kandi n'Abasiria baryatwarwa Kiiri bari enkwatwa;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Mmareho abatwire omuri Ashidoodi,
N'okwaitse enkoni y'obugabe omuri Ashikelooni;
Ndyabangira Ekurooni omukono gwangye, ngiteere,
N'Abafilistia abatsigaireho bacwekyerere;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Kandi omugabe waabo aryatwarwa omu bukwatwa,
We hamwe n'abanyiginya be;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

2:
Ndyagiihamu omutegyeki,
Mmwite hamwe n'abanyiginya baayo boona;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Nibaribatiirira emitwe y'abooro omu mucuucu,
Nibakiikamya emihanda y'abacureezi;
Omushaija na ishe nibaza aha mwishiki omwe,
Bireetera eiziina ryangye eririkwera kujumwa;

Kandi na rugambwa omu mamanzi
Ahari eryo izooba aryahunga ajwaire busha;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

3:
Entare etsinzire;
Mbwenu n'oha otarikwija kutiina?
Mukama RUHANGA agambire;
N'oha orikubaasa kwezibira kuhanuura?

Enju y'omuri katumba ndyagisheenya hamwe n'ey'omu kyanda;
N'amaju g'emiino y'enjojo garyahwerekyerera,
Kandi na zaanyaruju ziryahwaho;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

4:
Nimwije Beseeli, mucumure;
Mwije Gilugaali, mukanyise ebicumuro;
Mureete ebitambo byanyu buri kasheeshe,
N'ebicweka byanyu bya kimwe kya ikumi buri biro bishatu;

Muhongye empongano zaanyu z'okusiima, zirimu ekitumbisa,
Kandi murangye empongano ezi muhonga mwekundiire,
Muzirangaane hoona;
Ahakuba ebyo nibyo mwenda, imwe Baisraeli 'mwe;
nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.

Nkababuza eky'okutamira omu ndembo zaanyu zoona,
Amaino gaanyu gaaguma nigeera, ahu mutwire hoona;
Kwonka nabwo timwangarukira;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

N'ahabw'ekyo ab'omu ndembo ibiri nari ishatu
Bakaba bazegyerera omu rurembo rumwe
Kunywa amaizi, babura kuhwa eiriho;
Kwonka nabwo timwangarukira;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Nkabateeza okubabuka n'okusya-nyamwenga,
Naacwekyereza emisiri yaanyu n'ey'emizaabibu;
Emitiini yaanyu n'emizeituuni yaanyu yaariibwa enzigye;
Kwonka nabwo timwangarukira;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Nkabooherereza orufu nk'orwa Misri,
Naitsa abatsigazi baanyu rurara,
Naanyaga embaraasi zaanyu,
Enyindo zaanyu naaziitsa ekinuuko ky'orusisiira rwanyu;
Kwonka nabwo timwangarukira;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Nkajuumika endembo zaanyu,
Nk'oku Ruhanga yaajuumikire Sodoma na Gomora.
Mwaba nk'ekicumurwa kiihirwe omu muriro;
Kwonka nabwo hoona timurangarukiire;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Nikyo ndikugirira ntyo, iwe Israeli,
N'ahabw'ekyo yeteekateekye kubugabugana na Ruhanga waawe, iwe Israeli;
ahabw'okuba niinyija kukugira ntyo.

5:
N'omu misiri y'emizaabibu yoona haryabamu okuborooga,
Ahabw'okuba ndyaraba ahagati omuriimwe;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Imwe abarikwetenga eizooba rya MUKAMA, muryakareeba!
Mbwenu eryo izooba rya MUKAMA nimuryendera ki?
N'ery'omwirima, ti ry'omushana;

6:
Mwambukye Kalune, mureebe;
Murugyeyo, muze Hamasi enkuru;
Bwanyima mushuume Gaasi ey'Abafilistia.
Nimugira ngu nizihita ezi nsi z'obugabe?
Nari shi ensi yaazo neekira eyaanyu obuhango,

Abanywera amaarwa aha bishare,
Bakeesiiga amajuta marungi munonga;
Kwonka batasaasibwe kucwekyerera kwa Yosefu!

Ahakuba reeba, ndyaimutsya eihanga, ribarwanise,
Imwe b'enju ya Israeli 'mwe;
Ribabonabonese okuruga aharikutaahirwa Hamasi,
Okuhika aha kagyera k'omuri Araba;
nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'amahe, arikugira.

8:
Yangira ati: Iwe Amosi, nooreeba ki? Naamugarukamu nti: Nindeeba ekiibo ky'ebijuma by'omu kyanda. MUKAMA nikwo kungira ati:
Omuheru gw'abantu bangye Israeli gwahika;
Tindibasaasira bundi.

Eryo izooba ebyeshongoro by'omuri hekalu
Biryahinduka okuborooga;
Emitumbi y'abafu eryaba mingi,
Abantu baginaganagye hoona, bari omu kaceceko;
nikwo Mukama RUNANGA arikugira.

9:
Nkareeba MUKAMA ayemereire aha rubaju rw'eitambiro; kandi yaagira ati:
Teera emitwe y'enyomyo, okuhitsya obu ebisasi biraatengyete;
Ogisheenyagurire aha mitwe y'abantu boona;
Abaraahonokyeho mbaitse rurara;
Tihariho n'omwe omuribo oraahungye,
Tihariho n'omwe omuribo oraakire.

Reeba, amaisho ga Mukama RUHANGA
Gari aha bugabe oburikukora ebibi,
Ndyabucwekyereza, mbumare aha nsi;
Kwonka enju ya Yakobo yo, tindigicwekyerereza kimwe;
nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.

Eryo izooba ndyaimutsya eihema rya Daudi eryagwire,
Ndibaziire ahataagukire;
Nyimutsye ebicwagurika byaryo,
Ndyombekye, ribe nk'oku ryabaire riri obunyakare;

Babone kukubuura ekicweka kya Edomu ekyatsigaireho,
N'amahanga goona agarikwetererwa eiziina ryangye;
nikwo MUKAMA orikukora ebyo arikugira.

1:
Abakwatanisa naiwe boona bakubeihire,
Baakubinga, baakuhitsya aha mwatano;
Abantu abu ogira nabo obusingye bakusingwire,
Banywani baawe abu orikwesiga bakutegire omutego;
Kwonka tiwaakimanya.

Kwonka okaba otashemereire kuteerera murumuna waawe omu kwahwa
Aha izooba eri yaagwereirweho akagwe;
Okaba otashemereire kwesiimirana Abayuda
Aha izooba eri baacwekyerereziibweho;
Okaba otashemereire kwehimbisa
Aha izooba ry'okweshobera;

Ahabw'okuba eizooba rya MUKAMA riri haihi kuhika aha mahanga goona.
Nk'oku mwagizire, naimwe nikwo murigirwa;
Ebi mwakozire, biryabahindukana.

Enju ya Yakobo eryaba omuriro;
Enju ya Yosefu eryaba ekirimi ky'omuriro,
N'enju ya Esau ebe nk'ebitsintsi by'embuba.
Baryabootsya, babamareho,
Habure owaahonokaho aha b'omuri egyo nju;
Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA niwe yaakigamba.

Abajuni baryainamuka aha rushozi Saayuuni
Kutegyeka orushozi rwa Esau;
Kandi obugabe buryaba obwa MUKAMA.

2:
Omutima gwangye ku gwagwire enshazi,
Naakwijuka, MUKAMA;
Okushaba kwangye kwahika omuri hekalu yaawe erikwera.

Kwonka nyowe ndyakutambira ebitambo n'eiraka ry'okusiima;
Eki naahigire nindaganisa, ndyakihikiiriza.
Okujuna n'okwa MUKAMA.

1:
Imwe bantu 'mwe, mwena, nimuhurire;
Naiwe ensi n'ebigirimu byona, mutegye amatu;
Mukama RUHANGA abe niwe yaababeera mushinja,
Naayema omuri hekalu ye erikwera.

Ahabw'okuba obuhuta bwe ti bw'okutambwa;
Buhikire ahari Yuda,
Bwahika n'aha irembo ry'abantu bangye omuri Yerusaalemu.

Imwe batuuzi ba Shafiri 'mwe,
Murabeho mujwaire busha, mwine enshoni;
Abatuuzi ba Zaanani tibarikushohora;
Okuborooga kwa Betazeeli
Kuryabazibira ku ebaha emikono.

Naimwe batuuzi ba Mareesha 'mwe,
Ndyagaruka mbareeteho ow'okubasingura;
Kandi ekitiinisa kya Israeli kiryahika Adulaamu.

2:
Nibeetenga ebibanja by'abandi, babikwata;
Kandi beetenga n'amaju, baganyaga;
Bahata omuntu n'eka ye,
Omuntu n'obuhunguzi bwe.

Eryo izooba baryayeshongora ekyeshongoro ky'okubagaaniiza,
Baboroogye, nibatonzya n'obusaasi bwingi,
Nibagira bati: Tumariirweho kimwe;
Yaahingisa omugabo gw'abantu bangye;
Mbwenu ka yaaguunyaka!
Emisiri yaitu agibaganisiize abarikutunyaga.

Batyo nibahanuura bati: Mutahanuura!
Omuntu tashemereire kuhanuura ebigambo nk'ebi;
Okuhemuka tikurituhikaho.

Omuntu orikugyendagyenda, naagamba eby'omwoyo n'eby'ebishuba,
Naagira ati: Niinyija kubahanuurira ebya viinyo n'ebirikusinza;
Ogwo niwe yaakuba nabi w'aba bantu!

3:
Nikyo biribabeerera ekiro, mukabura okworekwa,
Bikababeera omwirima, mukabura okuragura;
Eizooba riryarengyera ahari baanabi,
Na nyomushana ebairagurire;

4:
Aryaramura amahanga maingi,
Ahane amahanga g'amaani agari hare;
Zaarurara zaabo baryaziheeshamu amafuka,
N'amacumu gaabo bagaheeshemu empabyo;
Eihanga tiriribangira rindi rurara,
Kandi tibarigaruka kwega by'engamba;

5:
Mbwenu oyehinguririziibwe orugo rw'amabaare;
Twagotwa;
Nibateeza omutegyeki wa Israeli
Enkono aha matama.

6:
Muryabiba, kwonka timurigyesha;
Muryanyuuka ebyana by'emitiini,
Kwonka timuryesiiga majuta gaabyo;
Muryanyuuka ebijuma by'emizaabibu,
Kwonka timurinywa viinyo yaabyo;

7:
Muteesiga omutaahi,
Mutagira obwesigye ahari munywani waanyu;
Kandi okwate akanwa
Nangwa n'aha mukazi waawe ou ofumbata;

Iwe muzigu wangye 'we, otaanyesiimirana;
N'obu ndigwa, ndyaimuka;
N'obu ndishutama omu mwirima,
MUKAMA aryambeera omushana.

1:
Ni naama ki mbi, ei murikugirira MUKAMA?
Aryamariraho kimwe;
Abazigu be taribahoora bwa kabiri.

2:
Omusheenyaguzi aizire kukurwanisa;
Ta abarinzi aha ngo z'amabaare;
Guma otaire amaisho aha muhanda,
Oyezirikye, oyegaruremu amaani gaawe goona.

Engabo z'amamanzi ge nizitukurikana,
Abaserukare be bajwaire ebijwaro bya karari;
Ebigaari ebitengire orugamba
Nibimurinkana nk'ekirimi ky'omuriro;
Embaraasi nizikangaza,

Ebigaari by'orugamba nibirigitira omu mihanda rugyendwa;
Nibimurinkana nk'emuri,
Kandi nibirabya nk'omurabyo.

3:
Oru rurembo orurikusheesha eshagama ruryakareeba.
Rwona rwijwire ebishuba n'obunyagi;
Eminyago yaarwo terikubarwa.

Abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi nibeeroha omu rugamba,
Zaarurara nizityankana, n'amacumu nigamurinkana;
Enyanja y'abantu eitsirwe,
Emitumbi etungamiraine etarikubaasa kubarwa;
Abantu nibagiteeraho entsibo.

Esiopia na Misri zikaba ziri amaani gaayo
Agataine bugarukiro;
Aba Puuti n'Abalibya bakaba bari abahwezi baayo.

Reeba, abaserukare baawe abari omuriiwe n'abakazi;
Amarembo g'ensi yaawe gaiguriirwe abazigu,
Omuriro gwokize empimbi zaawe.

1:
Nimwetegyereze omu muhanga, mureebe;
Mutangaare, mute engaro aha munwa;
Ahabw'okuba ninkora omurimo omu biro byanyu,
Ogu mutarikubaasa kwikiriza, n'obu mwakugambirwa muta.

2:
Ahabw'okuba ebi waayorekwa ebyo biine obunaku bwabyo obwatairweho;
Tibirituuraho kuhikiirizibwa,
Kandi tibiribeiha.
N'obu byakutuuraho, obitegyereze;
Buzimazima biryaija, tibirikyerererwa.

Enaama ei waagizire, okamaraho amahanga maingi,
Okahemura eka yaawe;
Waareebya amagara gaawe.

3:
Okumurinkana kwe kwaba nk'omushana,
Amaranzi gaaturuka omu ngaro ze nigarabya;
Kandi okwo niyo yaasherekire amaani ge.

Yaayemerera, yaagyera ensi;
Yaanaga amaisho, yaatengyetsa amahanga;
Obwo enshozi ezituuraho zaataataanisibwa,
N'ebibungo by'ebiro byona byabandama,
Emitwarize ye yaaba nk'eya ira.

1:
Ndyabangira Yuda omukono,
N'abatwire omuri Yerusaalemu boona;
Kandi omuri ogu mwanya ndyamaramu aba Baali abatsigaireho,
Mmareho eiziina ry'abanyamurwa abarikuramya ebishushani;

Eizooba rya MUKAMA erikuru riri haihi;
Riri haihi, kandi nirirahuka munonga;
Nimuhurire! Eizooba rya MUKAMA!
Emanzi neetakirayo munonga.

2:
Imwe abacureezi b'omu nsi mwena,
Abakora ebi MUKAMA aragiira,
Nimumusherure;
Kandi musherure okuhikiirira n'obucureezi;
Obundi mukaasherekwa aha izooba ry'ekiniga kya MUKAMA.

3:
Abategyeki baamwo n'entare ezirikutsinda,
Abaramuzi baarwo n'emishega y'omu mwabazyo
Etagira ki etsiga okuhitsya omu kasheehe;

MUKAMA ori ahagati yaarwo n'ohikiriire,
Takora kubi;
Buri kasheeshe areeta eby'oburyo bye omu mushana,
Tayosha;
Kwonka otahikiriire tagira kashoni.

Mmazireho amahanga,
Eminaara yaago n'ebisheenyuka;
Nyitiire kimwe enguuto zaago,
Ngu hatagira owaazirabamu;
Endembo zaago zihindukire amatongo,
Zaabura omuntu, zaabura n'ow'okuzituuramu.

Iwe Israeli, eryo izooba torikwatwa nshoni
Ahabw'ebi waakozire nongomera;
Ahabw'okuba obwo ndyakwihamu
Abanyamaryo baawe abarikwehimbisa;
Kandi torigaruka kwekunikira
Ha rushozi rwangye orurikwera.

Ahakuba ndyakutsigamu
Abantu abacureezi kandi abatarikwetunguura;
Baryasherura obuhungiro omu iziina rya MUKAMA.

9:
Ashikelooni eryakireeba, etiine;
Na Gaaza ekireebe, egire obusaasi bwingi;
Na Ekurooni yoona, ahabw'okuba ebi yaayesigire bihindukire busha.
Gaaza eryabura omugabe,
Na Ashikelooni ebure ab'okugituuramu;

Bwanyima ndyateera orusiisira aha nju yangye,
Ngyehinguririze nk'abarinzi,
Harekye kugira abaaguma nibarabaho;
Tihariho ihanga eririkuhata eririgaruka kubajuumikira;
Ahakuba hati nimbyereebera.

Imwe mbohe z'amatsiko 'mwe, nimugarukye aha kigo kyanyu;
Eri izooba nimpamya ku ndibashumbuusha
Ebirimu ebyanyu kabiri.

MUKAMA ow'amahe aryabarinda;
Baryamaraho abarekyezi b'enjungu, babaribatiirire;
Baryanywa eshagama yaabo nka viinyo,
Baijure nk'orwabya,
Ebajubye nk'ey'aha nshonda z'eitambiro.

10:
Nyiniire abariisa ekiniga ekirikubuguma,
N'abeebembezi b'abantu ndyabafubira;
Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ow'amahe naasaasibwa obusyo bwe,
Niyo nju ya Yuda;
Aryabagira nk'embaraasi ye y'ekitiinisa omu rugamba.

Ndyahamya ab'enju ya Yuda,
Njune ab'enju ya Yosefu;
Ndyabagarura, ahabw'okuba mbainiire esaasi,
Kandi baryaba nk'abu ntakacwaga;
Ahabw'okuba ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo,
Kandi ndyaguma mbagarukyemu.

Ndyabeetesa engaro, mbataaruure,
Ahabw'okuba nkabacungura;
Kandi baryaba baingi nk'obunyakare.

13:
MUKAMA naagira ati: Omuri egyo nsi yoona
Ebicweka bibiri bya kashatu biryamarwaho, bicwekyerere;
Kwonka kimwe kya kashatu kiryatsigaraho kihuriire.

6:
Obukama bwawe bwije;
Ebi okunda bikorwe omu nsi
Nk'oku bikorwa omu iguru;

11:
Kandi ogwo niwe owaahandiikirweho ngu,
Reeba, nintuma entumwa yangye, ekubandize;
niyo erishemeza omuhanda gwawe.

13:
Ebi Isaaya yaaragwire bibahikireho, ebi yaagizire ati:
Okuhurira kwo muryahurira, kwonka timurishoborokyerwa;
Okureeba kwo muryareeba, kwonka timuryetegyereza;

1:
nk'oku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabo kya nabi Isaaya, ngu:
Reeba, nintuma entumwa yangye, ekubandize;
Niyo erishemeza omuhanda gwawe.

Ahabw'okuba aryaba mukuru omu maisho ga Mukama;
Tarinywa viinyo, n'obu kyakuba ekirikusinza kyona;
Kandi aryaijura Omwoyo Orikwera okuruga omu nda ya nyina.

7:
Kandi ogwo niwe yaahandiikirweho ngu,
Reeba, nintuma entumwa yangye, ekubandize;
Niyo erishemeza omuhanda gwawe.

2:
Ruhanga akagira ati: Omu biro by'aha muheru
Ndyashuka Omwoyo wangye aha bantu boona;
Batabani baanyu na bahara baanyu baryaragura;
Abatsigazi baanyu baryayorekwa,
N'abagurusi baanyu baryaroota ebirooto;

Ndyayoreka eby'okutangaaza omu iguru ahaiguru,
N'obumanyiso omu nsi ahansi,
Eshagama n'omuriro n'okucumba kw'omwika;

Kandi Daudi akamugambaho ati:
Nkaba ndeeba Mukama omu maisho gangye obutoosha,
Ahakuba atuura aha rubaju rwangye rwa buryo, ngu ntanyiganyiga;

8:
Omu kugarurwa ahansi kwe bakamwitira orubanja;
Oruganda rwe n'oha orirushoboorora?
Ahakuba amagara ge gakaihwa omu nsi.

15:
Bwanyima y'ebyo ndyagaruka,
Nyimutsye enju ya Daudi eyaagwire;
Ahu yaasheenyukire ndyahashemeza, mpaimutsye,

28:
Gyenda aha b'eihanga eri, obagire oti:
Okuhurira kwo muryahurira, kwonka timurishoborokyerwa;
Okureeba kwo muryareeba, kwonka timuryetegyereza;

3:
Rubuuza! Ka tuhamye Ruhanga ku aba ow'amazima, n'obu omuntu weena yaakuba omunyabishuba, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:
Obe ohikiriire omu bigambo byawe;
Osingye, ku oraacwerwe orubanja.

Emimiro yaabo n'ekituuro ekirangaire,
Bagobya n'endimi zaabo,
Obushegu bw'encwera buri omu minwa yaabo;

11:
obwo Abaisraeli boona baryajunwa, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:
Omujuni aryaruga omuri Saayuuni,
Aihe omuri Yakobo okutatiina Ruhanga;

6:
ahakuba We agira ati:
Omu bunaku bw'okwikiririzibwamu nkakuhurira;
Kandi aha izooba ry'okujunirwaho naakuhwera.
Reeba, hati nibwo bunaku bw'okwikiririzibwamu buzima;
Reeba, hati niryo izooba ry'okujunirwaho.

N'ahabw'ekyo mubarugyemu,
Mubeetaaniseho; nikwo Mukama arikugira;
Mutarikora aha kintu kyona ekitashemeire;
Obwo naanye ndyabaakiira,

9:
Nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:
Akateera hoona embibo, yaagabira abooro;
Okuhikiirira kwe nikugumaho ebiro byona.

1:
Okakunda okuhikiirira, waayanga obugomi;
Nikyo Ruhanga, Ruhanga waawe, yaakushukiireho amajuta
G'okushemererwa okukira bagyenzi baawe.

Kandi ati:
Iwe, Mukama, omu kutandika okataho omusingi gw'ensi,
N'eiguru rikahangwa emikono yaawe;

3:
Nikyo naagwerirwe kubi ab'obusingye obwo,
Ningira nti: Emitima yaabo ehaba obutoosha;
Kandi tibakamanyire mihanda yangye.

5:
Na mbwenu Kristo nawe tareekurize ngu aheebwe obunyamurwa obukuru, kureka akabuteebwaho Ogwo owaamugizire ati:
Ori Omwana wangye,
Eri izooba naakuzaara;

8:
Kwonka egi niyo ndagaano ei ndiragaana n'enju ya Israeli
Bwanyima y'ebiro ebyo, nikwo Mukama arikugira;
Ndyata ebiragiro byangye omu bwengye bwabo,
Kandi aha mitima yaabo niho ndibihandiika;
Nyowe ndyaba Ruhanga waabo,
Nabo babe abantu bangye.

10:
N'ahabw'ekyo Kristo, ku yaabaire naija omu nsi, yaagira ati:
Ebitambo n'empongano torabikunzire,
Kureka okanteekateekyera omubiri;

2:
N'ahabw'ekyo ahariimwe abarikwikiriza n'Ow'obuguzi bwingi, kwonka aha batarikwikiriza kikahandiikwa ngu,
Eibaare eri abombeki baayangire
Niryo ryahindukire ery'obuhamizo bw'enju;

16:
Naahurira maraika naagira ati:
Iwe Orikwera, oriho, kandi owaabaireho,
Ori ohikiriire, ahabw'okucwa otyo emanja;

Ahakuba bakasheesha eshagama y'abarikwera n'eya baanabi;
Mbwenu obahaire eshagama kuginywa;
Kandi nikyo kibashemereire.
